out the three O acceptance + command availability + rollback. The README/wiki sync is part of the task goal but the test method focuses on the three test paths. However, KR4 mentions README/wiki sync and `git status .rick/domain/` no changes. The test method (测试方法) lists only 3 paths:\n1. 正常路径 (三 O 验收)\n2. 边界 (命令全可用)\n3. 异常 (回滚兜底)\n\nSo I should focus on these 3 test paths. But the test method also says \"前置条件 = ...\". Let me stick to the 测试方法 as the primary spec, since the test script prompt says \"根据上面的'测试方法'实现每个测试步骤\".\n\nThe 测试方法 is the authoritative source for the test script:\n1. 正常路径（三 O 验收）: \n   - O1: 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\n   - O2: 5 目录存在 + 6 冗余包 `test ! -d`\n   - O3: workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\n2. 边界（命令全可用）: `./bin/rick --help` + 8 个子命令 `--help`; 均 exit 0、无 panic、含 plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\n3. 异常（回滚兜底）: git worktree add + build + --help exit 0\n\nNow let me understand the agentdir.go for RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR and the actual agent deployment location.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_MFxxNvot4ZD9YSUFTCtR7628","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/runtime/agentdir.go"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_QTWnLPRhjfVkWyUqRcRH6853","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/check.go"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1798,"output":1625,"cacheRead":45184,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1513,"totalTokens":48607,"cost":{"input":0.00078213,"output":0.00141375,"cacheRead":0.000163792,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0023596719999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915939796,"responseId":"8e2063b9-3c24-4297-b577-2a7aafcd2229","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
