{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_QTWnLPRhjfVkWyUqRcRH6853","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package env\n\nimport (\n\t\"os/exec\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"\n)\n\n// requiredRickAgents 是 rick 自定义 agent 的清单（对应 AgentDir()/agents/<name>.md）。\n// think/research/exporter 由 env 职责 3 落盘（task9）并在此注册为就绪 check 的\n// 必需项：任一文件缺失即报未就绪。\nvar requiredRickAgents = []string{\"think\", \"research\", \"exporter\"}\n\n// IsPIReady 汇总所有功能点就绪判定，返回 (ok, missing)。ok=true 且 missing 为空\n// 表示 pi 环境就绪。纯「功能点就绪」，不含任何 session 校验（session 归 runtime）。\nfunc IsPIReady() (bool, []string) {\n\tmissing := CheckReady()\n\treturn len(missing) == 0, missing\n}\n\n// CheckReady 汇总四职责的功能点就绪，返回未就绪点清单（空 = 全部就绪）。\nfunc CheckReady() []string {\n\tvar missing []string\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckPIInstalled()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckEcosystemExtensions()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckRickAgents()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckRickHooks()...)\n\treturn missing\n}\n\n// CheckPIInstalled 检查 pi agent 是否可用（托管 runtime 二进制或 PATH pi）。\n// 就绪返回 nil，否则返回缺失描述。\nfunc CheckPIInstalled() []string {\n\tif runtime.FileExists(runtime.RuntimeBin()) {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\tif _, err := exec.LookPath(\"pi\"); err == nil {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn []string{\"pi runtime not installed\"}\n}\n\n// CheckEcosystemExtensions 检查 pi 生态扩展（pi-subagents/pi-web-access）是否\n// 注册。就绪返回 nil，缺失时返回未注册扩展名。\nfunc CheckEcosystemExtensions() []string {\n\treturn VerifyExtensions()\n}\n\n// CheckRickAgents 检查 rick 自定义 agent（think/research/exporter）是否落盘到\n// AgentDir()/agents/<name>.md。就绪返回 nil，缺失时返回缺失 agent 名。\nfunc CheckRickAgents() []string {\n\tvar missing []string\n\tfor _, name := range requiredRickAgents {\n\t\tif !runtime.FileExists(filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"agents\", name+\".md\")) {\n\t\t\tmissing = append(missing, name)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn missing\n}\n\n// CheckRickHooks 检查 rick-gates hook 扩展是否落盘\n// （AgentDir()/extensions/rick-gates/helper.py）。就绪返回 nil。\nfunc CheckRickHooks() []string {\n\tp := filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"extensions\", \"rick-gates\", \"helper.py\")\n\tif !runtime.FileExists(p) {\n\t\treturn []string{\"rick-gates\"}\n\t}\n\treturn nil\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915956036}}
{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a comprehensive understanding of the task. Let me now understand the full test method and what exactly I need to test.\n\nThe test script needs to cover:\n\n### Test 1: 正常路径 (三 O 验收)\n**O1 (spec 信息内核)**:\n- `test -f .rick/domain/spec.md` and `test -f .rick/domain/rick-spec.md` exist\n- `for w in 模块边界 职责 接口契约 验收标准; do grep -q \"$w\" .rick/domain/rick-spec.md` (all four elements keywords)\n- Also spec.md should contain the four elements (per the prompt: \"O1 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\")\n- `grep -q '功能等价' .rick/domain/rick-spec.md` (functional equivalence)\n- `grep -qE 'dry-run|go test|集成测试' .rick/domain/spec.md` (operational criteria enumerated)\n\n**O2 (三层金字塔 + 做薄)**:\n- 5 directories exist: `internal/cmd`, `internal/handler`, `internal/env`, `internal/builder`, `internal/runtime`\n- 6 redundant packages deleted: `for d in executor parser actpath logging git agent; do test ! -d internal/$d`\n\n**O3 (pibuilder pi 对齐)**:\n- `grep -rc workflowScript internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l` ≥1 (workflowScript/runs.run count >0)\n- 3 agent files exist: `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` (or `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/...`)\n- rick-gates helper.py exists: `test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py`\n- rick-gates extension deployed: `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` \n- natural language trigger words decreased (compared to baseline)\n\n### Test 2: 边界 (命令全可用)\n- `./bin/rick --help` exit 0, no panic\n- 8 subcommands `--help` each exit 0, no panic: plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\n\n### Test 3: 异常 (回滚兜底)\n- Record current release commit\n- `git worktree add /tmp/rick-rollback <release-commit>`\n- `cd /tmp/rick-rollback && ./scripts/build.sh && ./bin/rick --help` (exit 0)\n- Verify rollback works, doesn't pollute main workspace, `.rick/domain/` has no task12 changes\n\nNow, I need to think about the key details:\n\n