st will fail — which is correct RED behavior.\n\nBut wait, let me re-read the task prompt's \"测试质量自检\" section:\n\n> **根据运行结果判断**：\n> - 输出 `\"pass\": false` → 符合预期，测试正确覆盖了待实现的功能\n> - 输出 `\"pass\": true` → 需要判断原因：\n>   - ✅ **可接受**：该功能已被前面的 task 顺带实现，测试通过是合理的\n>   - ❌ **需重写**：功能尚未实现但测试已通过，说明测试逻辑有缺陷（如断言过弱、检查对象错误），**必须重新编写测试脚本**\n\nSo the test should verify the acceptance criteria. Since this is task12 (the last task), the actual acceptance is being verified. The features should already be implemented (task8~11 done). But the O3 agent deployment (think/research/exporter落盘为 pi agent) depends on `rick tools init-pi` being run.\n\nHmm, actually, wait. Let me reconsider. The deployment of agents happens via `rick tools init-pi`. But actually, looking more carefully at the check: the agents are deployed to `AgentDir()/agents/{name}.md`. The `AgentDir()` default is `~/.rick/pi/agent`. So the agents should be at `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/think.md` etc.\n\nBut they're not there. Let me check if maybe `rick tools init-pi` needs to be run. Let me check what `tools init-pi` does and whether there's a different deployment mechanism.\n\nActually, let me check the customizations.go and env.go to fully understand.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8rokqYdPGllT093C5m6m7017","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/customizations.go"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_KveSATBbg539HRCYQZ077160","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/env.go"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":581,"output":987,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":877,"totalTokens":52256,"cost":{"input":0.000252735,"output":0.0008586900000000001,"cacheRead":0.000183744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.001295169}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915963993,"responseId":"2d95085a-5fa0-4cbc-ac77-10b58092dbcd","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
