{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"So the deployment happens via `rick tools init-pi` (which calls `Ensure()` → `DeployRickCustomizations()`). The agents would be deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`.\n\nBut currently `~/.rick/pi/agent/` has no `agents/` directory, and no `extensions/` directory. This means `rick tools init-pi` hasn't been run recently, OR the deployment is failing.\n\nWait, let me check if `rick tools init-pi` has been run. Actually, the prerequisite says \"`rick tools init-pi` 已成功\". Let me check if maybe the deploy already happened but I need to verify.\n\nActually, let me re-read. The `~/.rick/pi/agent/` directory has:\n- auth.json, bin, missions, models-store.json, npm, run-history.jsonl, runtime, sessions, settings.json, themes, web-search-cache\n\nNo `agents/`, no `extensions/`, no `skills/`. So `DeployRickCustomizations()` has NOT been run, or it's failing.\n\nHmm wait, actually let me check if maybe `rick tools init-pi` was run but `DeployRickCustomizations` failed silently (it's `_ = DeployRickCustomizations()` in Ensure()).\n\nActually, for the test script, the key question is: what should the test verify?\n\nThe test method (测试方法) for O3 says: \"O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\".\n\nAnd KR1 O3: \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\".\n\nSo there are two interpretations:\n1. The agents must be deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/` (the default AgentDir) — this is the actual deployment location, and it's what \"落盘为 pi agent\" means.\n2. Or the test can use `RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>` and run `rick tools init-pi` to deploy to temp.\n\nActually, reading KR1 more carefully: \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\".\n\nThis suggests the test should:\n- Set RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR to a temp dir (or use default)\n- Run `rick tools init-pi` (or at least DeployRickCustomizations)\n- Check the agents + extensions are deployed\n\nBut the 测试方法 (测试方法 section, which is the authoritative spec for the test script) says simply:\n\"O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\"\n\nThis is a simpler version. The test method in the prompt's \"测试方法\" section is what I must follow:\n\n```\n正常路径（三 O 验收）：前置条件 = task8~11 完成 + `rick tools init-pi` 已成功；输入 = 无；操作 = 依次执行 KR1 的三组断言（O1 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价；O2 5 目录存在 + 6 冗余包 `test ! -d`；O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py）；预期 = 全部通过。\n```\n\nSo the O3 check in the test method is:\n1. workflowScript 计数 ≥1\n2. 3 个 agent 文件 (think/research/exporter)\n3. rick-gates helper.py\n\nThe \"3 个 agent 文件\" — where? The test method doesn't specify exactly. But KR1 clarifies: `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`.\n\nSo the test should check `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` (default AgentDir). But wait — the default AgentDir in the Go code is `~/.rick/pi/agent`. So the agent files should be at `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/think.md`, etc.\n\nBut currently they're not there. This means either:\n1. `rick tools init-pi` hasn't been run (prerequisite not met)\n2. The deployment is broken\n\nFor the test script, I need to check this. If the agents aren't deployed, the test should fail (RED).\n\nActually, wait. Let me think about this more carefully. The test should verify the acceptance criteria. The acceptance criteria is that the agents are deployed (落盘为 pi agent). The deployment happens via `rick tools init-pi`. \n\nBut the test script itself should NOT run `rick tools init-pi` (that's a prerequisite, \"前置条件\"). The test script verifies that the prerequisite was met — i.e., that the agents ARE deployed.\n\nHmm, but actually, running `rick tools init-pi` as part of the test would be \"执行任务本身\" which is forbidden (\"只生成测试脚本，不要执行任务本身\").\n\nSo the test should just VERIFY the current state:\n1. Check `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` exist (3 agent files)\n2. Check `~/.rick/pi/agent/extensions/rick-gates/helper.py` exists (rick-gates deployed)\n3. Check `.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py` exists (source)\n\nGiven that the agents are NOT currently deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`, the test would FAIL on this check. Is that the correct RED behavior?\n\nWell, per TDD and the task prompt: \"测试质量自检\" says if the test outputs `\"pass\": false`, that's \"符合预期，测试正确覆盖了待实现的功能\". But task12 is the LAST task — the acceptance should be verifying that everything is done.\n\nHmm, but actually, wait. Let me reconsider. The task12 goal is \"三个 O 端到端验收\". The test verifies the three O acceptance. The agents being deployed requires `rick tools init-pi` to have been run. \n\nLet me check: has `rick tools init-pi` been run? The presence of `runtime/`, `themes/`, `settings.json` in `~/.rick/pi/agent/` suggests it HAS been run (init-pi installs runtime, themes, settings). But `agents/` and `extensions/` are missing.\n\nWait, actually let me look more carefully. The `DeployRickCustomizations` copies:\n- rick-gates → `extensions/rick-gates/`\n- skills → `skills/`\n- agents → `agents/`\n\nNone of these are in `~/.rick/pi/agent/`. But `runtime/`, `themes/`, `settings.json` are there.\n\nHmm, this is strange. Let me check whether `rick tools init-pi` actually calls `DeployRickCustomizations`. From env.go Ensure() step 5: `_ = DeployRickCustomizations()`. So it should be called.\n\nBut wait — maybe the issue is that `DeployRickCustomizations` calls `workspace.GetRickDir()` which returns the repo's `.rick` directory, and then looks for `skills` inside it. If the repo is `/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick`, then `.rick/skills` exists with rick-gates and all the skills.\n\nActually wait, let me check whether `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents` was created but then removed, or if the last init-pi run happened before the agents feature (task9) was implemented.\n\nActually, looking at timestamps: `~/.rick/pi/agent/settings.json` is Aug 13 01:08, `sessions` Aug 17 01:50, `run-history.jsonl` Aug 17 00:54, `missions` Aug 12 20:19, `themes` Aug 12 20:31.\n\nThe task9 (agents) was committed at Aug 17 03:51. So the last `rick tools init-pi` run was probably BEFORE task9 was done. That's why agents aren't deployed.\n\nSo for the test to PASS, someone needs to run `rick tools init-pi` again (the prerequisite). \n\nBut the test script itself should NOT run init-pi (that's \"执行任务本身\"). The test verifies the current state.\n\nHmm, but actually, let me reconsider. The test's job is to verify acceptance. If I write a test that checks `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` exist, it will currently FAIL. That's a correct RED test — it correctly identifies that the acceptance criterion \"agents落盘为 pi agent\" is NOT yet met (because init-pi hasn't been re-run after task9).\n\nBut wait — is this the right thing to test? The task12 test is meant to be the final acceptance. The 测试质量自检 says:\n\n> 输出 `\"pass\": false` → 符合预期，测试正确覆盖了待实现的功能\n\nBut task12's \"待实现的功能\" is actually the doc sync (README/wiki) + the three-O acceptance. The three-O acceptance requires the agents to be deployed, which requires init-pi to be run.\n\nActually, I think I'm overcomplicating this. Let me step back and focus on what the test script should do, following the 测试方法 exactly:\n\n1. **正常路径（三 O 验收）**:\n   - O1: two spec files exist + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\n   - O2: 5 dirs exist + 6 redundant packages `test ! -d`\n   - O3: workflowScript count ≥1 + 3 agent files + rick-gates helper.py\n\n2. **边界（命令全可用）**: `./bin/rick --help` + 8 subcommands `--help` → all exit 0, no panic, contain plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\n\n3. **异常（回滚兜底）**: git worktree rollback verification\n\nFor O3's \"3 个 agent 文件\", the exact location matters. Let me interpret based on KR1: the agents are at `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`.\n\nThere are two ways the test can verify this:\n1. Check the default location `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/` — but this may not be deployed yet.\n2. Set `RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>` and actually run the deployment (`rick tools init-pi` or directly call the deploy), then check the temp dir.\n\nHmm. The KR1 says \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\".\n\nThis reads like: after setting RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR (to a temp or default), run the deployment, then check the files exist. This is an active verification (deploy then check).\n\nBut the 测试方法's operation is \"依次执行 KR1 的三组断言\" — execute the three groups of assertions from KR1. So I should follow KR1's exact assertions.\n\nKR1 O3 assertion:\n```\ngrep -rc workflowScript internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l ≥1\nexport RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>（或改用 ~/.rick/pi/agent 默认路径）后，$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md 3 文件存在 + $RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/ 已部署\ntest -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py\n自然语言触发词计数下降\n```\n\nSo the test should:\n1. workflowScript count ≥1\n2. Deploy agents to a temp RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR and verify 3 agent files + rick-gates extension deployed\n3. `test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py`\n4. natural language trigger count decreased\n\nFor #2, the deployment to temp dir: how to deploy? Run `rick tools init-pi` with RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR set? Or directly run a Go function?\n\nActually, running `rick tools init-pi` would be heavy (installs pi runtime, npm extensions, etc.). That's not appropriate for a test script.\n\nAlternatively, I can check whether the agents are deployed to the DEFAULT location `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`. Since the prerequisite says \"`rick tools init-pi` 已成功\", the agents should already be deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/`.\n\nHmm, but they're not deployed currently. So either:\n1. The test should fail (correct RED — agents not deployed yet, init-pi needs re-run)\n2. Or I should deploy to a temp dir as part of the test.\n\nLet me think about what's the most faithful interpretation of the 测试方法.\n\nThe 测试方法 says: \"操作 = 依次执行 KR1 的三组断言\". KR1 O3 = \"workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\".\n\nThe most natural reading: check that the 3 agent files exist (at the deployed location), and rick-gates helper.py exists.\n\nBut there's ambiguity about the location. Let me check what a reasonable test would do.\n\nActually, I realize I should look at how the previous test scripts (task8, task9, task10, task11) handled similar checks, especially task9 which was about agents. Let me check task9.py's agent check logic."}}
