eline.\n\nLet me now write the complete script.\n\nStructure:\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"task12 test script...\"\"\"\nimport json, os, re, shutil, subprocess, sys, tempfile\n\n# paths\n# regex\n# helpers: find_repo_root, run, read_text, write_file, md_files, total_matches, files_with_match, read_baseline\n# deploy go program\n# main()\n\ndef main():\n    errors = []\n    repo_root = find_repo_root()\n    if repo_root is None: ...\n    \n    # snapshot .rick/domain status\n    domain_before = git_status_domain()\n    \n    # ===== Test 1: 正常路径 三 O =====\n    # O1\n    # O2\n    # O3\n    \n    # ===== Test 2: 边界 命令全可用 =====\n    # ===== Test 3: 异常 回滚兜底 =====\n    \n    # final .rick/domain check\n    domain_after = git_status_domain()\n    \n    result = ...\n    print(json.dumps(result))\n    sys.exit(...)\n```\n\nLet me write it all out now.\n\nFor the O1 operational criteria check, I'll use regex `dry-run|go test|集成测试` on spec.md content.\n\nFor O2, 5 dirs + 6 redundant.\n\nFor O3:\n- workflowScript count: `files_with_match(WORKFLOW_RE) >= 1` where WORKFLOW_RE matches `workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all`. Actually KR1 says `grep -rc workflowScript ... | grep -v ':0' | wc -l` ≥1, which counts files containing \"workflowScript\". But the task description says \"workflowScript/runs.run 出现 >0\". I'll count files containing `workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all` and assert ≥1. Both give ≥1 (8 and 14). I'll use the broader regex to match \"workflowScript/runs.run 出现 >0\" from the O3 description. Actually, to be safe and match both, I'll check files_with_match for `workflowScript` ≥1 AND also total matches of `workflowScript|runs.run` > 0. Let me keep it simple: assert `files_with_match(WORKFLOW_RE) >= 1` where WORKFLOW_RE = `workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all`, AND additionally `total_matches` for `workflowScript` alone >= 1 (to match KR1's explicit workflowScript check).\n\nActually, let me just do:\n- `workflow_files = files_with_match(re.compile(r'