":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the structure. Let me look at the task12 dir and read the key artifacts more thoroughly:\n\n1. task12 dir contents\n2. The templates (to check workflowScript/runs.run)\n3. The rick-gates helper.py (to verify it's a script)\n4. The env/agents.go (to see how think/research/exporter agents are registered)\n5. README.md and wiki/ to understand doc sync\n\nLet me also check what \"落盘为 pi agent\" means - where do agents get written? The env module has agents.go. Let me read it.\n\nAlso need to understand the \"四要素\" four elements: 模块边界 (module boundary), 职责 (responsibility), 接口契约 (interface contract), 验收标准 (acceptance criteria). And \"验收标准\" acceptance criteria.\n\nFor O2: \n- 5 directories exist: internal/{cmd,handler,env,builder,runtime}\n- 6 redundant packages removed: internal/{executor,parser,actpath,logging,git,agent} → `test ! -d`\n- rick all commands available\n\nFor O3:\n- workflowScript count >= 1 in templates\n- 3 agent files (think/research/exporter) 落盘为 pi agent\n- rick-gates helper.py (gate carried by rick-gates hook + script)\n- natural language trigger words decreased\n\nLet me read the key files to understand exact checks.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_Z4rpHgt5BAlfBlV4Kq082105","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===task12 dir===\" && ls -la .rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tasks/task12/ && echo \"===task12.md content===\" && cat .rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tasks/task12/*.md 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_JM141XrPp6j2p1i3vC9B3842","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/agents.go"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_d58dwdy3VFhvZCAltUCW0916","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2180,"output":527,"cacheRead":31232,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":302,"totalTokens":33939,"cost":{"input":0.0009483,"output":0.00045849000000000004,"cacheRead":0.00011321600000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.001520006}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915912618,"responseId":"14264257-02ea-48f0-ac81-db8943814b96","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_Z4rpHgt5BAlfBlV4Kq082105","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===task12 dir===\ntotal 592\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys   4096 Aug 17 05:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 14 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys   4096 Aug 17 05:31 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 595703 Aug 17 05:31 raw_session_test_gen.log\n===task12.md content===\n\n\nCommand exited with code 1"}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1786915919225},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_JM141XrPp6j2p1i3vC9B3842","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package env\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\t\"strings\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/prompt\"\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"\n)\n\n// rickAgentSpec 描述一个 rick 自定义 agent：frontmatter 字段 + system prompt\n// 来源（embedded templates/skills/{name}.md，即对应源码 skill 的 wiki 内容）。\ntype rickAgentSpec struct {\n\tname           string\n\tdescription    string\n\ttools          string // 逗号分隔的 pi 工具名（与 pi-subagents tools 字段对齐）\n\tdefaultContext string\n}\n\n// rickAgents 是 rick 经 env 职责 3 注册为 pi 自定义 agent 的清单\n// （think/research/exporter）。system prompt = 对应源码 skill 的 wiki 正文。\nvar rickAgents = []rickAgentSpec{\n\t{\n\t\tname:           \"think\",\n\t\tdescription:    \"推理过程分析 + 4 维风险评估 + 启发性 3 问方法论（SENSE 的 S2 假设枚举与 EC 批判）\",\n\t\ttools:          \"read, grep, find, ls\",\n\t\tdefaultContext: \"fresh\",\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\tname:           \"research\",\n\t\tdescription:    \"尽调树 + 信源加权方法论（澄清事实模糊性到极限）\",\n\t\ttools:          \"read, grep, find, ls, bash, web_search, fetch_content\",\n\t\tdefaultContext: \"fresh\",\n\t},\n\t{\n\t\tname:           \"exporter\",\n\t\tdescription:    \"RFC 输出方法论（大纲 + 内容两阶段固化）\",\n\t\ttools:          \"read, write, bash\",\n\t\tdefaultContext: \"fresh\",\n\t},\n}\n\n// deployRickAgents 将 rick 自定义 agent 幂等写入 AgentDir()/agents/{name}.md。\n// 覆盖语义：仅当目标文件不存在，或其 frontmatter 含 rick-managed: true 标记时\n// 才写入；无标记的同名文件（用户自定义）跳过，避免覆盖用户内容。\nfunc deployRickAgents() error {\n\tagentsDir := filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"agents\")\n\tif err := os.MkdirAll(agentsDir, 0755); err != nil {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"create agents dir: %w\", err)\n\t}\n\tfor _, spec := range rickAgents {\n\t\tif err := deployRickAgent(agentsDir, spec); err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn nil\n}\n\n// deployRickAgent 写入单个 agent 文件（幂等 + rick 标记覆盖语义）。\nfunc deployRickAgent(agentsDir string, spec rickAgentSpec) error {\n\ttarget := filepath.Join(agentsDir, spec.name+\".md\")\n\tif data, err := os.ReadFile(target); err == nil {\n\t\tif !hasRickManagedMarker(string(data)) {\n\t\t\treturn nil // 无 rick 标记的用户文件，不覆盖。\n\t\t}\n\t} else if !os.IsNotExist(err) {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"read %s: %w\", target, err)\n\t}\n\n\tbody := prompt.LoadCoreSkills([]string{spec.name})\n\tif body == \"\" {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"embedded skill %q not found for agent %q\", spec.name, spec.name)\n\t}\n\tcontent := renderRickAgentFile(spec, body)\n\tif err := os.WriteFile(target, []byte(content), 0644); err != nil {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"write agent %s: %w\", spec.name, err)\n\t}\n\treturn nil\n}\n\n// renderRickAgentFile 渲染 agent 文件 = YAML frontmatter + system prompt 正文。\n// systemPromptMode: replace 使正文整体替换 pi 默认骨架（system prompt = wiki 内容）。\nfunc renderRickAgentFile(spec rickAgentSpec, body string) string {\n\treturn fmt.Sprintf(`---\nname: %s\ndescription: %s\ntools: %s\ndefaultContext: %s\nsystemPromptMode: replace\nrick-managed: true\n---\n\n%s`, spec.name, spec.description, spec.tools, spec.defaultContext, body)\n}\n\n// hasRickManagedMarker 判断 agent 文件 frontmatter 是否含 rick-managed: true。\n// frontmatter 由首行 --- 与随后的第一个 --- 行闭合；闭合前未找到标记即视为无。\n// 解析对齐 pi 前端 frontmatter 语义：key/value 按 \":\" 分割并 trim。\nfunc hasRickManagedMarker(content string) bool {\n\tlines := strings.Split(content, \"\\n\")\n\tif len(lines) == 0 || strings.TrimSpace(lines[0]) != \"---\" {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}\n\tfor _, ln := range lines[1:] {\n\t\ttrimmed := strings.TrimSpace(ln)\n\t\tif trimmed == \"---\" {\n\t\t\treturn false\n\t\t}\n\t\tif trimmed == \"\" || strings.HasPrefix(trimmed, \"#\") {\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\tkv := strings.SplitN(trimmed, \":\", 2)\n\t\tif len(kv) == 2 && strings.TrimSpace(kv[0]) == \"rick-managed\" && strings.TrimSpace(kv[1]) == \"true\" {\n\t\t\treturn true\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn false\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915919225},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_02_d58dwdy3VFhvZCAltUCW0916","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n# Description: rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\n\n\"\"\"rick-gates 门禁 helper — 确定性 doing 门禁校验。\n\nrick 侧确定性脚本（非 pi extension hook，hook 仅作通知/记录）。runtime.Run 在解析到\nagent_settled（pi 会话结束）后直接调用本脚本校验 doing 门禁，exit 非 0 = 门禁失败。\n\n校验语义（与原 doing_check 三项语义对齐）：\n1. tasks.json 可解析 —— doing/tasks.json 是合法 JSON 且含 tasks 数组。\n2. zombie 检测 —— 无遗留 running 状态任务。\n3. commit_hash 存在 —— status=success 的任务必须有非空 commit_hash。\n\n用法：python3 helper.py <doing_dir>\n\"\"\"\n\nimport json\nimport os\nimport sys\n\n\ndef main(argv):\n    if len(argv) < 2:\n        print(\"usage: helper.py <doing_dir>\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 2\n\n    doing_dir = argv[1]\n    tasks_json_path = os.path.join(doing_dir, \"tasks.json\")\n\n    # 1. tasks.json 可解析\n    try:\n        with open(tasks_json_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            data = json.load(f)\n    except Exception as e:  # noqa: BLE001 - 门禁错误串需兼容任意解析失败\n        print(\"tasks.json 不可解析: %s\" % e, file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    tasks = data.get(\"tasks\")\n    if not isinstance(tasks, list):\n        print(\"tasks.json 缺少 tasks 数组\", file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    for task in tasks:\n        task_id = task.get(\"task_id\", \"?\")\n        status = task.get(\"status\", \"\")\n\n        # 2. zombie 检测\n        if status == \"running\":\n            print(\"zombie running: task %s 仍处于 running 状态\" % task_id, file=sys.stderr)\n            return 1\n\n        # 3. commit_hash 存在\n        if status == \"success\":\n            commit_hash = task.get(\"commit_hash\", \"\")\n            if not commit_hash:\n                print(\"missing commit_hash: task %s 状态为 success 但 commit_hash 为空\" % task_id, file=sys.stderr)\n                return 1\n\n    print(\"gate passed\")\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    sys.exit(main(sys.argv))\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915919225},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the structure well. Let me check the task12 raw session log to understand any additional context, and check the README.md and wiki dir for doc sync. But actually I mainly need to understand what to test.\n\nLet me check:\n1. The templates for `workflowScript`/`runs.run` occurrence\n2. The wiki directory\n3. The README.md for doc sync (mentions of O1/O2/O3 or related)\n4. Check what commands are registered (the 8 subcommands)\n5. Check bin/rick exists and works\n6. Check the `internal/` for redundant packages (executor, parser, actpath, logging, git, agent) - should be absent\n\nLet me also look at the loop readme-wiki-sync-loop referenced, and check the raw_session_test_gen.log for context (it might contain the previous test gen session).\n\nLet me run some checks.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_oEMVwz2Tb9X7A8GcmJ5t3187","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===workflowScript/runs.run count in templates===\" && grep -roE 'workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all' internal/prompt/templates/ 2>/dev/null | wc -l && echo \"===files with workflowScript===\" && grep -rlE 'workflowScript|runs\\.run' internal/prompt/templates/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"===internal redundant dirs (should be absent)===\" && for d in executor parser actpath logging git agent; do if [ -d \"internal/$d\" ]; then echo \"EXISTS internal/$d\"; else echo \"absent internal/$d\"; fi; done && echo \"===5 dirs check===\" && for d in cmd handler env builder runtime; do if [ -d \"internal/$d\" ]; then echo \"OK internal/$d\"; else echo \"MISSING internal/$d\"; fi; done"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_LLbIq4ujHNHCCx6LRX134219","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===bin/rick===\" && ls -la bin/ && echo \"===rick --help===\" && ./bin/rick --help 2>&1 | head -40; echo \"exit=$?\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_nmN5VrOJhWAUCFlTqlNP0275","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===wiki dir===\" && ls -la wiki/ && echo \"===README head===\" && head -60 README.md && echo \"===grep 四要素 keywords in spec.md===\" && for kw in \"模块边界\" \"职责\" \"接口契约\" \"验收标准\"; do echo -n \"$kw: \"; grep -c \"$kw\" .rick/domain/spec.md; done && echo \"===rick-spec.md 四要素===\" && for kw in \"模块边界\" \"职责\" \"接口契约\" \"验收标准\"; do echo -n \"$kw: \"; grep -c \"$kw\" .rick/domain/rick-spec.md; done"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1876,"output":723,"cacheRead":33920,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":193,"totalTokens":36519,"cost":{"input":0.0008160600000000001,"output":0.00062901,"cacheRead":0.00012296,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0015680300000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915919226,"responseId":"b0ea70bb-fb8e-4901-9a9a-e9f0b9d4c250","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_oEMVwz2Tb9X7A8GcmJ5t3187","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===workflowScript/runs.run count in templates===\n61\n===files with workflowScript===\ninternal/prompt/templates/dream.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/doing.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/plan.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/exporter.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/sense_loop.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/research.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/ctrl.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/skills/doing_loop.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/skills/gen-loop.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/skills/exporter.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/skills/debug_skill.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/skills/research.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/skills/learning_loop.md\ninternal/prompt/templates/think.md\n===internal redundant dirs (should be absent)===\nabsent internal/executor\nabsent internal/parser\nabsent internal/actpath\nabsent internal/logging\nabsent internal/git\nabsent internal/agent\n===5 dirs check===\nOK internal/cmd\nOK internal/handler\nOK internal/env\nOK internal/builder\nOK internal/runtime\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915926524},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_LLbIq4ujHNHCCx6LRX134219","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===bin/rick===\ntotal 7084\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    4096 Aug 17 05:29 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 13 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    4096 Aug 17 05:07 ..\n-rwxrwxr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 7245753 Aug 17 05:29 rick\n===rick --help===\nRick CLI is a comprehensive tool for managing development workflows, including job planning, task execution, and learning documentation.\n\nUsage:\n  rick [flags]\n  rick [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\n  ctrl        Monitor and intervene in a background doing session\n  doing       Execute tasks in a job\n  dream       Cross-job global reflection and skill evolution\n  easy        Start an interactive easy AI coding session\n  help        Help about any command\n  human-loop  Start a human-loop thinking session with AI assistance\n  learning    Analyze and document learnings from job execution\n  plan        Plan a new job with AI assistance\n  tools       Meta-skill tools for validating and managing Rick workflows\n\nFlags:\n      --dry-run      Run in dry-run mode without making changes\n  -h, --help         help for rick\n      --job string   Specify job ID (e.g., job_1)\n  -v, --verbose      Enable verbose output\n  -V, --version      Show version\n\nUse \"rick [command] --help\" for more information about a command.\nexit=0\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915926524},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_02_nmN5VrOJhWAUCFlTqlNP0275","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===wiki dir===\ntotal 216\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 18:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 13 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 05:07 ..\n-rw-rw-r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 18877 Aug 12 18:32 architecture.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  9721 Aug  7 19:53 CONTRIBUTING.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 25993 Aug  7 19:53 dag-execution.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 24419 Aug  7 19:53 installation.md\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug  7 19:53 modules\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 35713 Aug  7 19:53 prompt-system.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4979 Aug  7 19:53 README.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 24772 Aug  7 19:53 runtime-flow.md\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 31095 Aug  7 19:53 testing.md\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  5441 Aug  7 19:53 validate_wiki.sh\n-rw-r--r--  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  8026 Aug  7 19:53 VALIDATION_REPORT.md\n===README head===\n# Rick CLI\n\n> 对抗上下文熵增的 AI Coding 控制框架\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TB\n    subgraph Human[\"人类入口（白箱）\"]\n        HL[\"rick human-loop\"]\n        PLAN[\"rick plan\"]\n        EASY[\"rick doing --easy / rick easy\"]\n        CTRL[\"rick ctrl\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Exec[\"执行层\"]\n        DOING[\"rick doing\"]\n        SUB[\"Sub Agent 工作流<br/>ANALYZE→RED→GREEN→REFACTOR→COMMIT\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Knowledge[\"知识层（.rick/）\"]\n        EXEC_DIM[\"执行维度<br/>loops / skills\"]\n        VAL_DIM[\"价值维度<br/>domain / draft\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Evolve[\"进化层\"]\n        LEARN[\"rick learning\"]\n        DREAM[\"rick dream\"]\n    end\n\n    PLAN --> DOING\n    EASY --> DOING\n    DOING --> SUB\n    SUB --> Knowledge\n    CTRL -.干预.-> DOING\n    HL --> VAL_DIM\n    SUB --> LEARN\n    LEARN --> Knowledge\n    DREAM --> Knowledge\n    DREAM -.淘汰/进化.-> EXEC_DIM\n```\n\n---\n\n## 设计哲学\n\n随着项目迭代，软件复杂性逐渐升高，这种复杂性表现为上下文的熵增——AI agent 在执行过程中积累的信息散落在对话历史、临时文件、个人记忆中，无法被结构化复用，导致后续的 AI coding 越跑越乱、越跑越不准。Rick 的核心公式是 `AICoding = Humans + Agents`，其中 `Agents = Models + Harness`，Harness 即上下文。一切设计都围绕上下文的生命周期展开：如何采集、如何压缩、如何复用、如何让它随项目演化保持整洁。\n\nRick 将上下文分为两个维度。**执行维度**承载\"怎么做\"的操作性知识：`loops` 是带验收标准的可复用工作流（如 TDD 的红绿重构循环），`skills` 是触发条件明确的原子能力（如\"修改 Go 源文件后必须验证编译通过\"）。**价值维度**承载\"是什么\"的描述性知识：`domain` 是代码事实的客观描述（命令规范、架构、编码约定），可被代码验证；`draft` 是个人判断信息的载体（human-loop 思考记录、RFC、未固化的概念探索），不可被代码直接验证。两者的边界清晰：当 `draft` 中的判断被代码事实验证并固化后，可迁移到 `domain`；`domain` 中过时部分由 `dream` 周期性清理。\n\n在这个视角下，命令体系是作用于知识体系的控制手段。`doing` 与 `easy` 是熵增的源头（执行过程产生上下文），`learning` 是增强回路（把单次 job 的经验提取为 loops/skills，让下次更准），`dream` 是调节回路（跨 job 反思、淘汰失效 loops/skills、维持 `domain` 简洁），`human-loop` 是人类介入深度思考的入口（产出 `draft`），`ctrl` 是黑箱执行的可挂测性设计（人类对 doing 进行干预）。主要矛盾是\"上下文熵增\"与\"AI coding 准确性\"之间的势能差，Rick 通过 learning 的增强回路和 dream 的调节回路共同对抗这一熵增，让后续的 AI agent 越跑越准。\n\n### pi 作为受控的执行后端\n\nRick 不直接调用大模型，而是把 [pi](https://pi.dev)（`@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent`）作为执行后端——一个可被 shell 调用的 agent runtime。Rick 自身是**引导程序**：确定性拼装 prompt/文件、注入系统提示词、约束工作流，pi 负责实际的 agentic 执行。这条边界的设计原则是**关注点分离**：\n\n- **用户不应感知 pi 的存在**。所有 pi 的配置（provider/model/api-key、subagent/web-access 扩展、主题）都通过 `rick tools init-pi` 引导完成，用户只需跑 rick，不需要直接操作 pi。\n- **Rick 托管 pi 的配置以控制模型输入**。pi 的扩展、skill、system prompt 都是模型输入的一部分——这些若由用户随意配置，会污染 agent 的上下文（上下文熵增的又一来源）。Rick 主动安装并固化 pi 的扩展配置（而非让用户各自装），正是为了对\"喂给模型的输入\"拥有更强的控制力，保证 pi 作为 rick 执行后端的**可控性**与**一致性**。\n- **Node 是用户管理的环境依赖**。pi 是 Node.js 程序，需要 node ≥22.19.0 + npm。Rick 不替用户装 node——它是环境依赖，用户负责（保持 rick 引导的简洁性）。`rick tools init-pi` 只在\"需要安装 pi\"时检查 node/npm 是否就绪，缺失则终止并提示用户自行安装；pi 已装时则假定环境就绪，不再检查。\n\n**配置目录隔离（已实现）**：rick 对 pi 的托管通过**配置目录隔离**落地——rick 在 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 下维护专属于自己的 pi 配置（settings、扩展、主题），在**所有** pi 调用入口（交互式 plan/easy/ctrl/human-loop、doing 的 `--mode json`、`rick tools init-pi` 自身的 install/list）注入环境变量 `PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR` 指向它，与用户自有的 `~/.pi` 完全隔离。用户直接跑 pi 仍用自己的 `~/.pi`；rick 跑 pi 走 `~/.rick/pi`——两套配置互不污染。这样 rick 对\"喂给 pi 的全部模型输入\"（system prompt、扩展、skill）拥有完全控制力，用户此前自行装的扩展/skill 不会泄漏进 rick 的 agent 上下文。这是\"控制上下文熵增\"理念在执行后端层的延伸：不仅要治理 rick 自身产出的上下文，还要治理 pi 这个后端被喂入的上下文。\n\n===grep 四要素 keywords in spec.md===\n模块边界: 3\n职责: 10\n接口契约: 4\n验收标准: 10\n===rick-spec.md 四要素===\n模块边界: 2\n职责: 14\n接口契约: 2\n验收标准: 3\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915926524},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have a good understanding. Let me look at the raw_session_test_gen.log to see if there's any additional context from the previous test gen session. Actually, it's 595KB - probably not needed. Let me check the key remaining details.\n\nLet me verify:\n1. The 8 subcommands: plan, doing, easy, learning, dream, tools, human-loop, ctrl (from `--help`). The prompt says \"8 个子命令\" and \"含 plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\". Note: `tools` is a command but the prompt says \"8 个子命令\" and lists plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl = 8 commands. Wait, that's 8: plan, doing, easy, learning, dream, tools, human-loop, ctrl. Yes, 8.\n\nActually wait, the `--help` also lists `completion` and `help`. But the task prompt explicitly lists the 8 to check: plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl.\n\n2. The O1 check: two spec files + 四要素关键词 (four elements keywords) + 功能等价 (functional equivalence). The four elements are: 模块边界 (module boundary), 职责 (responsibility), 接口契约 (interface contract), 验收标准 (acceptance criteria). Both files must contain these keywords + 验收标准.\n\nWait, re-reading the task:\n- O1（spec 信息内核）：`.rick/domain/spec.md` + `.rick/domain/rick-spec.md` 存在且含四要素 + 验收标准\n\nSo both files must exist, contain the four elements. The four elements are 模块边界/职责/接口契约/验收标准. Actually the \"四要素 + 验收标准\" phrasing suggests four elements which already includes 验收标准. Let me interpret: 四要素 = 模块边界, 职责, 接口契约, 验收标准. And \"验收标准\" is one of the four. The phrase \"含四要素 + 验收标准\" is a bit redundant but likely means: contain all four elements (which include 验收标准/acceptance criteria) AND acceptance criteria.\n\nThe test method says: \"O1 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\". So check:\n- Both spec.md and rick-spec.md exist\n- Contain 四要素 keywords: 模块边界, 职责, 接口契约, 验收标准\n- 功能等价 (functional equivalence keyword) — the phrase \"功能等价\" appears in the files\n\n3. For O3: \n- workflowScript count >= 1 in templates (61 found)\n- 3 agent files (think/research/exporter) 落盘为 pi agent — check the AgentDir()/agents/{name}.md exist. Where is AgentDir()? Let me check runtime.AgentDir().\n\n4. rick-gates helper.py exists (the gate carried by rick-gates hook + script).\n\n5. natural language trigger words decreased — compare to baseline (109). Current count in templates after migration should be < 109.\n\nLet me check where AgentDir() points to, and check the \"落盘为 pi agent\" - the actual written agent files.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_oa53UswidLScxdzZi4dj7779","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===runtime AgentDir===\" && grep -rn 'func AgentDir\\|func RuntimeDir\\|func RuntimeBin\\|func AgentEnv' internal/runtime/ internal/workspace/ 2>/dev/null; echo \"===runtime files===\" && ls internal/runtime/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_Qv0eWMs9Cnh8e9ZAcUeL7043","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===search AgentDir def===\" && grep -rn 'AgentDir' internal/ --include='*.go' | head -20"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_02_dtTC823LtMd