1 says: 正则口径与 RFC §2.1 基线一致：含 bare `subagent`/`Sub Agent`/`SPAWN`/`子 Agent`.\n\nThe trigger-baseline.txt contains 109. This baseline was dumped by task11.py's regex. Let me check what the current count is with task11.py's regex.\n\nActually, let me check the current trigger count in templates. The baseline is 109. Let me verify the current count with the same regex.\n\nActually, I should reuse task11.py's exact regex to be consistent with the baseline that was dumped. The trigger-baseline.txt was written by task11.py --dump-baseline with its regex. So to compare \"下降\" (decrease), I should use the same regex.\n\nLet me check the current count with task11's regex.\n\nActually, let me look at what the baseline represents and verify. Let me also check the agentdir.go to understand RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR.\n\nLet me also verify the loop readme-wiki-sync-loop and check README/wiki sync requirement. But actually the test script is primarily about the three O acceptance + command availability + rollback. The README/wiki sync is part of the task goal but the test method focuses on the three test paths. However, KR4 mentions README/wiki sync and `git status .rick/domain/` no changes. The test method (测试方法) lists only 3 paths:\n1. 正常路径 (三 O 验收)\n2. 边界 (命令全可用)\n3. 异常 (回滚兜底)\n\nSo I should focus on these 3 test paths. But the test method also says \"前置条件 = ...\". Let me stick to the 测试方法 as the primary spec, since the test script prompt says \"根据上面的'测试方法'实现每个测试步骤\".\n\nThe 测试方法 is the authoritative source for the test script:\n1. 正常路径（三 O 验收）: \n   - O1: 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\n   - O2: 5 目录存在 + 6 冗余包 `test ! -d`\n   - O3: workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\n2. 边界（命令全可用）: `./bin/rick --help` + 8 个子命令 `--help`; 均 exit 0、无 panic、含 plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\n3. 异常（回滚兜底）: git worktree add + build + --help exit 0\n\nNow let me understand the agentdir.go for RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR and the actual agent deployment location.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_MFxxNvot4ZD9YSUFTCtR7628","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/runtime/agentdir.go"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_QTWnLPRhjfVkWyUqRcRH6853","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/check.go"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1798,"output":1625,"cacheRead":45184,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1513,"totalTokens":48607,"cost":{"input":0.00078213,"output":0.00141375,"cacheRead":0.000163792,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0023596719999999997}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915939796,"responseId":"8e2063b9-3c24-4297-b577-2a7aafcd2229","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_MFxxNvot4ZD9YSUFTCtR7628","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package runtime\n\nimport (\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n)\n\n// rickAgentDirEnv overrides where rick keeps its managed pi configuration.\n// Tests set it to a temp dir so no real ~/.rick/pi is touched. It is NOT\n// PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR: that is the env var pi itself reads, which rick\n// injects into every pi subprocess (see AgentEnv).\nconst rickAgentDirEnv = \"RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR\"\n\n// AgentDir returns the directory where rick manages pi's entire configuration\n// (~/.rick/pi/agent). rick injects this path as PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR into every\n// pi subprocess, so pi reads/writes its settings, extensions, themes and\n// packages exclusively under ~/.rick/pi — fully isolated from the user's own\n// ~/.pi (the user's standalone pi sessions keep their own config; rick's pi\n// sessions are self-contained and cannot be polluted by user-installed\n// extensions/skills).\nfunc AgentDir() string {\n\tif d := os.Getenv(rickAgentDirEnv); d != \"\" {\n\t\treturn d\n\t}\n\thome, err := os.UserHomeDir()\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\treturn \"\"\n\t}\n\treturn filepath.Join(home, \".rick\", \"pi\", \"agent\")\n}\n\n// SettingsPath returns the path of the rick-managed pi settings.json.\nfunc SettingsPath() string {\n\treturn filepath.Join(AgentDir(), \"settings.json\")\n}\n\n// RuntimeDir returns the npm prefix of rick's self-contained pi runtime\n// (agent/runtime). rick installs its own copy of the @earendil-works/\n// pi-coding-agent package here so it can patch pi's UI behavior (e.g. the diff\n// keyword highlight) without touching the user's global/standalone pi install.\n// Keeping it under AgentDir gives tests the same RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR isolation.\nfunc RuntimeDir() string {\n\treturn filepath.Join(AgentDir(), \"runtime\")\n}\n\n// RuntimeBin returns the pi binary shim of the managed runtime\n// (agent/runtime/node_modules/.bin/pi). Empty/invalid until installed.\nfunc RuntimeBin() string {\n\treturn filepath.Join(RuntimeDir(), \"node_modules\", \".bin\", \"pi\")\n}\n\n// FileExists reports whether path exists and is not a directory.\nfunc FileExists(path string) bool {\n\tinfo, err := os.Stat(path)\n\treturn err == nil && !info.IsDir()\n}\n\n// EnsureAgentDir creates the rick-managed pi agent directory (and parents).\nfunc EnsureAgentDir() error {\n\treturn os.MkdirAll(AgentDir(), 0755)\n}\n\n// AgentEnv returns the environment for pi subprocesses: the inherited\n// environment plus PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR pointing at rick's managed agent dir.\n// This is what makes the configuration isolation effective at every call site\n// (CallCLI for interactive plan/easy/ctrl/human-loop, Executor for doing's\n// --mode json, and rick's own `pi install`/`pi list`/`pi --version` runs).\nfunc AgentEnv() []string {\n\treturn append(os.Environ(), \"PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR=\"+AgentDir())\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915956036},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_QTWnLPRhjfVkWyUqRcRH6853","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package env\n\nimport (\n\t\"os/exec\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"\n)\n\n// requiredRickAgents 是 rick 自定义 agent 的清单（对应 AgentDir()/agents/<name>.md）。\n// think/research/exporter 由 env 职责 3 落盘（task9）并在此注册为就绪 check 的\n// 必需项：任一文件缺失即报未就绪。\nvar requiredRickAgents = []string{\"think\", \"research\", \"exporter\"}\n\n// IsPIReady 汇总所有功能点就绪判定，返回 (ok, missing)。ok=true 且 missing 为空\n// 表示 pi 环境就绪。纯「功能点就绪」，不含任何 session 校验（session 归 runtime）。\nfunc IsPIReady() (bool, []string) {\n\tmissing := CheckReady()\n\treturn len(missing) == 0, missing\n}\n\n// CheckReady 汇总四职责的功能点就绪，返回未就绪点清单（空 = 全部就绪）。\nfunc CheckReady() []string {\n\tvar missing []string\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckPIInstalled()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckEcosystemExtensions()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckRickAgents()...)\n\tmissing = append(missing, CheckRickHooks()...)\n\treturn missing\n}\n\n// CheckPIInstalled 检查 pi agent 是否可用（托管 runtime 二进制或 PATH pi）。\n// 就绪返回 nil，否则返回缺失描述。\nfunc CheckPIInstalled() []string {\n\tif runtime.FileExists(runtime.RuntimeBin()) {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\tif _, err := exec.LookPath(\"pi\"); err == nil {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn []string{\"pi runtime not installed\"}\n}\n\n// CheckEcosystemExtensions 检查 pi 生态扩展（pi-subagents/pi-web-access）是否\n// 注册。就绪返回 nil，缺失时返回未注册扩展名。\nfunc CheckEcosystemExtensions() []string {\n\treturn VerifyExtensions()\n}\n\n// CheckRickAgents 检查 rick 自定义 agent（think/research/exporter）是否落盘到\n// AgentDir()/agents/<name>.md。就绪返回 nil，缺失时返回缺失 agent 名。\nfunc CheckRickAgents() []string {\n\tvar missing []string\n\tfor _, name := range requiredRickAgents {\n\t\tif !runtime.FileExists(filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"agents\", name+\".md\")) {\n\t\t\tmissing = append(missing, name)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn missing\n}\n\n// CheckRickHooks 检查 rick-gates hook 扩展是否落盘\n// （AgentDir()/extensions/rick-gates/helper.py）。就绪返回 nil。\nfunc CheckRickHooks() []string {\n\tp := filepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"extensions\", \"rick-gates\", \"helper.py\")\n\tif !runtime.FileExists(p) {\n\t\treturn []string{\"rick-gates\"}\n\t}\n\treturn nil\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915956036},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand. The agents are deployed to `AgentDir()/agents/{name}.md` where AgentDir() is `~/.rick/pi/agent` by default, or `RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR` if set.\n\nThe test method KR1 for O3 says:\n- `grep -rc workflowScript internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l` ≥1\n- 显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\n- `test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py`\n- 自然语言触发词计数下降\n\nNow, the agents are deployed at runtime. The question is whether the agents are actually deployed in `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`. Since `rick tools init-pi` is a prerequisite (task8~11 完成 + `rick tools init-pi` 已成功), the agents should be deployed.\n\nBut wait — for the test script, I should check whether the agent files exist at the actual location. Since `rick tools init-pi` may or may not have been run, the agent files might be at `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`. Let me check if they exist.\n\nActually, the key question is: what should the test check? The test method says check `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 files exist + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` deployed.\n\nLet me check whether ~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/ exists.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_x1A4leaKpVzuczCDqTOH4042","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===HOME===\" && echo $HOME && echo \"===~/.rick/pi/agent===\" && ls -la ~/.rick/pi/agent/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"===agents===\" && ls -la ~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"===extensions===\" && ls -la ~/.rick/pi/agent/extensions/ 2>/dev/null && echo \"===rick-gates ext===\" && ls -la ~/.rick/pi/agent/extensions/rick-gates/ 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_ARVLvzL0AxitynEBvlnL6129","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===current trigger count (task11 regex)===\" && python3 -c \"\nimport re\nregex = re.compile(r'派发\\s*subagent|SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent|SPAWN\\s+Step|子\\s*Agent|父\\s*Agent|Main\\s+Agent|Sub\\s+Agent|每个\\s+subagent\\s+独立启动', re.IGNORECASE)\nimport os\nd='internal/prompt/templates'\ntotal=0\nfor dp,_,fs in os.walk(d):\n    for fn in fs:\n        if fn.endswith('.md'):\n            with open(os.path.join(dp,fn),encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                total+=len(regex.findall(f.read()))\nprint('current total:', total)\nprint('baseline: 109')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1475,"output":827,"cacheRead":48512,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":413,"totalTokens":50814,"cost":{"input":0.000641625,"output":0.00071949,"cacheRead":0.000175856,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.001536971}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915956037,"responseId":"ca8627c4-3cc4-4bf7-9d3b-78945df2aba3","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_x1A4leaKpVzuczCDqTOH4042","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===HOME===\n/home/hadoop-recsys\n===~/.rick/pi/agent===\ntotal 76\ndrwx------  9 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 05:31 .\ndrwxrwxr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 19:23 ..\n-rw-------  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys    95 Aug 12 20:32 auth.json\ndrwxrwxr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 19:58 bin\ndrwxrwxr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 20:19 missions\n-rw-------  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  1955 Aug 17 01:00 models-store.json\ndrwxrwxr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 19:35 npm\n-rw-------  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys 23625 Aug 17 00:54 run-history.jsonl\ndrwxr-xr-x  3 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 23:26 runtime\ndrwxrwxr-x 31 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 01:50 sessions\n-rw-------  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys   155 Aug 13 01:08 settings.json\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 20:31 themes\ndrwx------  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 13 10:57 web-search-cache\n===agents===\n\n\nCommand exited with code 2"}],"details":{},"isError":true,"timestamp":1786915963992},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_ARVLvzL0AxitynEBvlnL6129","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===current trigger count (task11 regex)===\ncurrent total: 0\nbaseline: 109\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915963992},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! There's no `agents` directory or `extensions` directory in `~/.rick/pi/agent/`. So the agents (think/research/exporter) are NOT deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`. And `extensions/rick-gates/` is not deployed either.\n\nWait, but the prerequisite is \"`rick tools init-pi` 已成功\". Maybe init-pi hasn't been run yet, or maybe the deployment happens at a different location.\n\nThe current trigger count is 0 (task11 regex), baseline 109, so natural language trigger words have decreased (0 < 109). Good, that passes.\n\nNow for O3, the agent files. Let me check:\n1. Whether the agents are deployed. They should be at `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`. But `~/.rick/pi/agent/` has no `agents/` directory.\n\nWait, but the test method KR1 O3 says: \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在\".\n\nSo the check is: after setting RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR to a temp dir (or using default `~/.rick/pi/agent`), the agent files exist. This means the deployment should have happened via `rick tools init-pi` (which calls env.DeployRickCustomizations()).\n\nSince the agents dir doesn't exist in `~/.rick/pi/agent/`, this suggests `rick tools init-pi` hasn't been run yet, OR the deployment is failing.\n\nActually wait, let me check more carefully. Let me check if there's a `tools init-pi` command that would deploy. And check the env.go / customizations.go to understand what `DeployRickCustomizations` does and where it deploys.\n\nActually, for the test script, the key question is what should I test. The test method says the prerequisite is \"task8~11 完成 + `rick tools init-pi` 已成功\". \n\nBut the TDD principle says I need to write a failing test first (RED phase). The test should check the acceptance criteria. If the agents are not yet deployed (because init-pi hasn't run), then the test will fail — which is correct RED behavior.\n\nBut wait, let me re-read the task prompt's \"测试质量自检\" section:\n\n> **根据运行结果判断**：\n> - 输出 `\"pass\": false` → 符合预期，测试正确覆盖了待实现的功能\n> - 输出 `\"pass\": true` → 需要判断原因：\n>   - ✅ **可接受**：该功能已被前面的 task 顺带实现，测试通过是合理的\n>   - ❌ **需重写**：功能尚未实现但测试已通过，说明测试逻辑有缺陷（如断言过弱、检查对象错误），**必须重新编写测试脚本**\n\nSo the test should verify the acceptance criteria. Since this is task12 (the last task), the actual acceptance is being verified. The features should already be implemented (task8~11 done). But the O3 agent deployment (think/research/exporter落盘为 pi agent) depends on `rick tools init-pi` being run.\n\nHmm, actually, wait. Let me reconsider. The deployment of agents happens via `rick tools init-pi`. But actually, looking more carefully at the check: the agents are deployed to `AgentDir()/agents/{name}.md`. The `AgentDir()` default is `~/.rick/pi/agent`. So the agents should be at `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/think.md` etc.\n\nBut they're not there. Let me check if maybe `rick tools init-pi` needs to be run. Let me check what `tools init-pi` does and whether there's a different deployment mechanism.\n\nActually, let me check the customizations.go and env.go to fully understand.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_8rokqYdPGllT093C5m6m7017","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/customizations.go"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_KveSATBbg539HRCYQZ077160","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/internal/env/env.go"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":581,"output":987,"cacheRead":50688,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":877,"totalTokens":52256,"cost":{"input":0.000252735,"output":0.0008586900000000001,"cacheRead":0.000183744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.001295169}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915963993,"responseId":"2d95085a-5fa0-4cbc-ac77-10b58092dbcd","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_8rokqYdPGllT093C5m6m7017","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"package env\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"path/filepath\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/workspace\"\n)\n\n// DeployRickCustomizations 落盘 rick 自有定制到 pi 托管 agent 目录（职责 3）：\n//\n//   - rick-gates hook 扩展：<repo>/.rick/skills/rick-gates/ → AgentDir()/extensions/rick-gates/\n//   - rick skills：<repo>/.rick/skills/*_skill/            → AgentDir()/skills/<name>/\n//   - rick agents：embedded templates/skills/{think,research,exporter}.md\n//     → AgentDir()/agents/{name}.md（task9，frontmatter + wiki 正文）\n//\n// 幂等：重复运行会重写目标文件（内容一致），不产生重复项。\nfunc DeployRickCustomizations() error {\n\trickDir, err := workspace.GetRickDir()\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"locate rick dir: %w\", err)\n\t}\n\tif err := deployRickCustomizations(filepath.Join(rickDir, \"skills\")); err != nil {\n\t\treturn err\n\t}\n\treturn deployRickAgents()\n}\n\n// deployRickCustomizations 从给定 skills 源目录复制 rick 定制，便于单测注入临时源目录。\nfunc deployRickCustomizations(skillsDir string) error {\n\t// rick-gates hook 扩展 → extensions/rick-gates/。\n\tif err := copyDir(filepath.Join(skillsDir, \"rick-gates\"),\n\t\tfilepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"extensions\", \"rick-gates\")); err != nil {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"deploy rick-gates: %w\", err)\n\t}\n\n\t// rick skills（*_skill 目录，含 skill.md）→ skills/。\n\tentries, err := os.ReadDir(skillsDir)\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\tif os.IsNotExist(err) {\n\t\t\treturn nil // 无 skills 目录 —— 无定制可部署。\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"read skills dir %s: %w\", skillsDir, err)\n\t}\n\tfor _, e := range entries {\n\t\tif !e.IsDir() || e.Name() == \"rick-gates\" {\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\t// 仅复制真正的 skill 目录（含 skill.md），跳过 README 等杂项。\n\t\tif !runtime.FileExists(filepath.Join(skillsDir, e.Name(), \"skill.md\")) {\n\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t}\n\t\tif err := copyDir(filepath.Join(skillsDir, e.Name()),\n\t\t\tfilepath.Join(runtime.AgentDir(), \"skills\", e.Name())); err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"deploy skill %s: %w\", e.Name(), err)\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\treturn nil\n}\n\n// copyDir 递归复制 src 目录到 dst，保留文件/目录权限。源不存在时返回 nil\n// （幂等 + 容错：部分定制可缺失而不阻断整体部署）。\nfunc copyDir(src, dst string) error {\n\tinfo, err := os.Stat(src)\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\tif os.IsNotExist(err) {\n\t\t\treturn nil\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn err\n\t}\n\tif !info.IsDir() {\n\t\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%s is not a directory\", src)\n\t}\n\treturn filepath.Walk(src, func(path string, fi os.FileInfo, walkErr error) error {\n\t\tif walkErr != nil {\n\t\t\treturn walkErr\n\t\t}\n\t\trel, err := filepath.Rel(src, path)\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t\ttarget := filepath.Join(dst, rel)\n\t\tif fi.IsDir() {\n\t\t\treturn os.MkdirAll(target, 0755)\n\t\t}\n\t\tdata, err := os.ReadFile(path)\n\t\tif err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t\tif err := os.MkdirAll(filepath.Dir(target), 0755); err != nil {\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t\tmode := fi.Mode().Perm()\n\t\tif mode == 0 {\n\t\t\tmode = 0644\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn os.WriteFile(target, data, mode)\n\t})\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915974705},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_01_KveSATBbg539HRCYQZ077160","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// Package env 收口 rick 的 agent runtime 环境管理（env 四职责）。\n//\n// env 保证 rick 在当前机器的运行环境就绪：pi 及扩展、rick 自有定制。它是四层\n// 架构第三层「执行」的一员，对下依赖 internal/runtime 暴露的共享路径工具\n// （AgentDir/RuntimeDir/RuntimeBin/SettingsPath/AgentEnv/FileExists/EnsureAgentDir），\n// 对上被 cli（薄入口）与 handler（调度聚合）调用。\n//\n// 四职责：\n//  1. 安装/更新 pi agent（pi.go）\n//  2. 安装/更新 pi 生态扩展/插件/skill（extensions.go）\n//  3. 安装/更新 rick 自有 hook/skill/agent 定制（customizations.go）\n//  4. 提供 pi 功能点就绪 check 函数，不含 session（check.go）\n//\n// 扩展 seam：RuntimeEnv 接口 + piEnv 实现，将来新增 dsh runtime 时只实现\n// dshEnv 并注册，cli/handler 不改。\npackage env\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\t\"strings\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/runtime\"\n)\n\n// RuntimeEnv 是 env 抽象的扩展 seam（单一 runtime pi + dsh 预留）。pi 是当前\n// 唯一实现；将来 dsh 只新增 dshEnv（安装方式/扩展机制/定制落盘格式/就绪 check\n// 各自实现）并注册，cli/handler/方法层 templates 不改。\ntype RuntimeEnv interface {\n\t// Ensure 保证 runtime 就绪（安装/更新 runtime + 生态扩展 + 功能点校验）。\n\tEnsure() error\n\t// DeployCustomizations 落盘 rick 自有定制（hook/skill/agent）。\n\tDeployCustomizations() error\n\t// CheckReady 返回未就绪的功能点（空切片 = 就绪）。\n\tCheckReady() []string\n}\n\n// piEnv 是 RuntimeEnv 的 pi 实现，四职责收口于此。\ntype piEnv struct{}\n\n// NewPiEnv 构造 pi env 实现。\nfunc NewPiEnv() *piEnv { return &piEnv{} }\n\n// Ensure 委托给包级 Ensure（完整 init-pi 流程）。\nfunc (e *piEnv) Ensure() error { return Ensure() }\n\n// DeployCustomizations 委托给包级 DeployRickCustomizations。\nfunc (e *piEnv) DeployCustomizations() error { return DeployRickCustomizations() }\n\n// CheckReady 委托给包级 CheckReady。\nfunc (e *piEnv) CheckReady() []string { return CheckReady() }\n\n// Ensure 执行完整的「保证 pi 就绪」流程并返回错误。仅在 pi 完全不可用（rick 无法\n// 运行）时返回错误；缺失扩展/主题/定制仅告警，不阻断。输出与迁移前 runInitPi 逐字\n// 一致（职责 3 定制落盘静默执行，不新增输出行）。\nfunc Ensure() error {\n\t// Step 0: 前置检查 —— 仅当 rick 托管 pi runtime 尚未安装时。pi 是 Node.js\n\t// 程序（>= 22.19.0），其 npm 安装需要 node/npm 在 PATH 上。rick 不安装 node\n\t// （用户管理的环境依赖）。托管 runtime 已存在时视为环境就绪，跳过此检查。\n\tif !runtime.FileExists(runtime.RuntimeBin()) {\n\t\tif err := RequireNodeForPiInstall(); err != nil {\n\t\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"❌ %v\\n\", err)\n\t\t\treturn err\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t// Step 1: rick 自闭环 pi runtime 就绪（缺失则安装）。\n\tpiPath, piNewlyInstalled, err := EnsurePI()\n\tif err != nil {\n\t\t// Fatal: 无 pi 则 rick 无法执行任何 agent 命令。\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"❌ pi is not available and could not be installed: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"   Install manually: npm install -g @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent\\n\")\n\t\treturn err\n\t}\n\tver := PiVersion(piPath)\n\tfmt.Printf(\"✅ rick pi runtime ready: %s\", piPath)\n\tif ver != \"\" {\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\" (v%s)\", ver)\n\t}\n\tif piNewlyInstalled {\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\" (newly installed)\")\n\t}\n\tfmt.Println()\n\n\t// Step 1.5: rick 托管 agent 目录 + settings 引导（隔离配置 + hideThinkingBlock）。\n\tif err := BootstrapAgentSettings(); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"⚠️  managed agent dir: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"   rick will still run, but pi config isolation may be incomplete.\\n\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\"✅ pi agent dir ready: %s (hideThinkingBlock=true)\\n\", runtime.AgentDir())\n\t}\n\n\t// Step 2: subagent 扩展注册（缺失则安装）。非致命。\n\tif err := EnsureNpmExtension(\"pi-subagents\", \"pi-subagents\"); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"⚠️  subagent extension: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"   rick works without it, but Sub Agent delegation is unavailable.\\n\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tfmt.Println(\"✅ pi subagent extension ready\")\n\t}\n\n\t// Step 3: web-access 扩展注册（缺失则安装）。非致命。\n\tif err := EnsureNpmExtension(\"pi-web-access\", \"web-access\"); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"⚠️  web-access extension: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"   rick works without it, but external web search/fetch is unavailable.\\n\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tfmt.Println(\"✅ pi web-access extension ready\")\n\t}\n\n\t// Step 4: 从托管配置清除 Tokyo Night 包。非致命。\n\tif err := PurgeTokyoNight(); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"⚠️  tokyo-night purge: %v\\n\", err)\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"   rick works without it; the package may still be listed.\\n\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tfmt.Println(\"✅ tokyo-night purged from managed config (theme/packages)\")\n\t}\n\n\t// Step 5: 校验所有必需扩展 + 主题已注册。\n\tmissing := VerifyExtensions()\n\tif len(missing) > 0 {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"⚠️  verification: these extensions are NOT registered: %s\\n\", strings.Join(missing, \", \"))\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"   rick may be degraded. Re-run `rick tools init-pi` or install manually.\\n\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tfmt.Println(\"✅ verification: all required extensions registered\")\n\t}\n\tif cur := CurrentTheme(); cur == \"\" {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"⚠️  verification: no theme set in settings.json\\n\")\n\t} else {\n\t\tfmt.Printf(\"✅ verification: theme %s active\\n\", cur)\n\t}\n\n\t// 职责 3：rick 自有定制（静默落盘，不影响 init-pi 输出基线）。\n\t_ = DeployRickCustomizations()\n\n\tfmt.Println(\"✅ pi environment ready\")\n\treturn nil\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915974705},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the deployment happens via `rick tools init-pi` (which calls `Ensure()` → `DeployRickCustomizations()`). The agents would be deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`.\n\nBut currently `~/.rick/pi/agent/` has no `agents/` directory, and no `extensions/` directory. This means `rick tools init-pi` hasn't been run recently, OR the deployment is failing.\n\nWait, let me check if `rick tools init-pi` has been run. Actually, the prerequisite says \"`rick tools init-pi` 已成功\". Let me check if maybe the deploy already happened but I need to verify.\n\nActually, let me re-read. The `~/.rick/pi/agent/` directory has:\n- auth.json, bin, missions, models-store.json, npm, run-history.jsonl, runtime, sessions, settings.json, themes, web-search-cache\n\nNo `agents/`, no `extensions/`, no `skills/`. So `DeployRickCustomizations()` has NOT been run, or it's failing.\n\nHmm wait, actually let me check if maybe `rick tools init-pi` was run but `DeployRickCustomizations` failed silently (it's `_ = DeployRickCustomizations()` in Ensure()).\n\nActually, for the test script, the key question is: what should the test verify?\n\nThe test method (测试方法) for O3 says: \"O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\".\n\nAnd KR1 O3: \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\".\n\nSo there are two interpretations:\n1. The agents must be deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/` (the default AgentDir) — this is the actual deployment location, and it's what \"落盘为 pi agent\" means.\n2. Or the test can use `RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>` and run `rick tools init-pi` to deploy to temp.\n\nActually, reading KR1 more carefully: \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\".\n\nThis suggests the test should:\n- Set RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR to a temp dir (or use default)\n- Run `rick tools init-pi` (or at least DeployRickCustomizations)\n- Check the agents + extensions are deployed\n\nBut the 测试方法 (测试方法 section, which is the authoritative spec for the test script) says simply:\n\"O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\"\n\nThis is a simpler version. The test method in the prompt's \"测试方法\" section is what I must follow:\n\n```\n正常路径（三 O 验收）：前置条件 = task8~11 完成 + `rick tools init-pi` 已成功；输入 = 无；操作 = 依次执行 KR1 的三组断言（O1 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价；O2 5 目录存在 + 6 冗余包 `test ! -d`；O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py）；预期 = 全部通过。\n```\n\nSo the O3 check in the test method is:\n1. workflowScript 计数 ≥1\n2. 3 个 agent 文件 (think/research/exporter)\n3. rick-gates helper.py\n\nThe \"3 个 agent 文件\" — where? The test method doesn't specify exactly. But KR1 clarifies: `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`.\n\nSo the test should check `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` (default AgentDir). But wait — the default AgentDir in the Go code is `~/.rick/pi/agent`. So the agent files should be at `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/think.md`, etc.\n\nBut currently they're not there. This means either:\n1. `rick tools init-pi` hasn't been run (prerequisite not met)\n2. The deployment is broken\n\nFor the test script, I need to check this. If the agents aren't deployed, the test should fail (RED).\n\nActually, wait. Let me think about this more carefully. The test should verify the acceptance criteria. The acceptance criteria is that the agents are deployed (落盘为 pi agent). The deployment happens via `rick tools init-pi`. \n\nBut the test script itself should NOT run `rick tools init-pi` (that's a prerequisite, \"前置条件\"). The test script verifies that the prerequisite was met — i.e., that the agents ARE deployed.\n\nHmm, but actually, running `rick tools init-pi` as part of the test would be \"执行任务本身\" which is forbidden (\"只生成测试脚本，不要执行任务本身\").\n\nSo the test should just VERIFY the current state:\n1. Check `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` exist (3 agent files)\n2. Check `~/.rick/pi/agent/extensions/rick-gates/helper.py` exists (rick-gates deployed)\n3. Check `.rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py` exists (source)\n\nGiven that the agents are NOT currently deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`, the test would FAIL on this check. Is that the correct RED behavior?\n\nWell, per TDD and the task prompt: \"测试质量自检\" says if the test outputs `\"pass\": false`, that's \"符合预期，测试正确覆盖了待实现的功能\". But task12 is the LAST task — the acceptance should be verifying that everything is done.\n\nHmm, but actually, wait. Let me reconsider. The task12 goal is \"三个 O 端到端验收\". The test verifies the three O acceptance. The agents being deployed requires `rick tools init-pi` to have been run. \n\nLet me check: has `rick tools init-pi` been run? The presence of `runtime/`, `themes/`, `settings.json` in `~/.rick/pi/agent/` suggests it HAS been run (init-pi installs runtime, themes, settings). But `agents/` and `extensions/` are missing.\n\nWait, actually let me look more carefully. The `DeployRickCustomizations` copies:\n- rick-gates → `extensions/rick-gates/`\n- skills → `skills/`\n- agents → `agents/`\n\nNone of these are in `~/.rick/pi/agent/`. But `runtime/`, `themes/`, `settings.json` are there.\n\nHmm, this is strange. Let me check whether `rick tools init-pi` actually calls `DeployRickCustomizations`. From env.go Ensure() step 5: `_ = DeployRickCustomizations()`. So it should be called.\n\nBut wait — maybe the issue is that `DeployRickCustomizations` calls `workspace.GetRickDir()` which returns the repo's `.rick` directory, and then looks for `skills` inside it. If the repo is `/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick`, then `.rick/skills` exists with rick-gates and all the skills.\n\nActually wait, let me check whether `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents` was created but then removed, or if the last init-pi run happened before the agents feature (task9) was implemented.\n\nActually, looking at timestamps: `~/.rick/pi/agent/settings.json` is Aug 13 01:08, `sessions` Aug 17 01:50, `run-history.jsonl` Aug 17 00:54, `missions` Aug 12 20:19, `themes` Aug 12 20:31.\n\nThe task9 (agents) was committed at Aug 17 03:51. So the last `rick tools init-pi` run was probably BEFORE task9 was done. That's why agents aren't deployed.\n\nSo for the test to PASS, someone needs to run `rick tools init-pi` again (the prerequisite). \n\nBut the test script itself should NOT run init-pi (that's \"执行任务本身\"). The test verifies the current state.\n\nHmm, but actually, let me reconsider. The test's job is to verify acceptance. If I write a test that checks `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` exist, it will currently FAIL. That's a correct RED test — it correctly identifies that the acceptance criterion \"agents落盘为 pi agent\" is NOT yet met (because init-pi hasn't been re-run after task9).\n\nBut wait — is this the right thing to test? The task12 test is meant to be the final acceptance. The 测试质量自检 says:\n\n> 输出 `\"pass\": false` → 符合预期，测试正确覆盖了待实现的功能\n\nBut task12's \"待实现的功能\" is actually the doc sync (README/wiki) + the three-O acceptance. The three-O acceptance requires the agents to be deployed, which requires init-pi to be run.\n\nActually, I think I'm overcomplicating this. Let me step back and focus on what the test script should do, following the 测试方法 exactly:\n\n1. **正常路径（三 O 验收）**:\n   - O1: two spec files exist + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\n   - O2: 5 dirs exist + 6 redundant packages `test ! -d`\n   - O3: workflowScript count ≥1 + 3 agent files + rick-gates helper.py\n\n2. **边界（命令全可用）**: `./bin/rick --help` + 8 subcommands `--help` → all exit 0, no panic, contain plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\n\n3. **异常（回滚兜底）**: git worktree rollback verification\n\nFor O3's \"3 个 agent 文件\", the exact location matters. Let me interpret based on KR1: the agents are at `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md`.\n\nThere are two ways the test can verify this:\n1. Check the default location `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/` — but this may not be deployed yet.\n2. Set `RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>` and actually run the deployment (`rick tools init-pi` or directly call the deploy), then check the temp dir.\n\nHmm. The KR1 says \"显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署\".\n\nThis reads like: after setting RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR (to a temp or default), run the deployment, then check the files exist. This is an active verification (deploy then check).\n\nBut the 测试方法's operation is \"依次执行 KR1 的三组断言\" — execute the three groups of assertions from KR1. So I should follow KR1's exact assertions.\n\nKR1 O3 assertion:\n```\ngrep -rc workflowScript internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l ≥1\nexport RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>（或改用 ~/.rick/pi/agent 默认路径）后，$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md 3 文件存在 + $RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/ 已部署\ntest -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py\n自然语言触发词计数下降\n```\n\nSo the test should:\n1. workflowScript count ≥1\n2. Deploy agents to a temp RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR and verify 3 agent files + rick-gates extension deployed\n3. `test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py`\n4. natural language trigger count decreased\n\nFor #2, the deployment to temp dir: how to deploy? Run `rick tools init-pi` with RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR set? Or directly run a Go function?\n\nActually, running `rick tools init-pi` would be heavy (installs pi runtime, npm extensions, etc.). That's not appropriate for a test script.\n\nAlternatively, I can check whether the agents are deployed to the DEFAULT location `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/`. Since the prerequisite says \"`rick tools init-pi` 已成功\", the agents should already be deployed to `~/.rick/pi/agent/`.\n\nHmm, but they're not deployed currently. So either:\n1. The test should fail (correct RED — agents not deployed yet, init-pi needs re-run)\n2. Or I should deploy to a temp dir as part of the test.\n\nLet me think about what's the most faithful interpretation of the 测试方法.\n\nThe 测试方法 says: \"操作 = 依次执行 KR1 的三组断言\". KR1 O3 = \"workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\".\n\nThe most natural reading: check that the 3 agent files exist (at the deployed location), and rick-gates helper.py exists.\n\nBut there's ambiguity about the location. Let me check what a reasonable test would do.\n\nActually, I realize I should look at how the previous test scripts (task8, task9, task10, task11) handled similar checks, especially task9 which was about agents. Let me check task9.py's agent check logic.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_ueZES11KXq9x6oTZf7lk1637","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task9.py"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":2634,"output":3234,"cacheRead":52224,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":3161,"totalTokens":58092,"cost":{"input":0.00114579,"output":0.00281358,"cacheRead":0.00018931200000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004148682}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915974706,"responseId":"6a625278-6ef2-4891-b50a-06cd9d142535","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_ueZES11KXq9x6oTZf7lk1637","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"task9 验收测试：注册 think/research/exporter 为 pi 自定义 agent（经 env 职责 3 落盘）。\n\n按 skill:tdd 四要素（前置条件/输入/操作/预期）实现测试方法三类断言，断言真实落盘文件、\n不 mock：用一个临时 Go 程序直接调用真实的 `env.DeployRickCustomizations()`（隔离\nRICK_PI_AGENT_DIR 指向 temp、程序内 chdir 到仓库根使 `.rick/skills` 源可见）。\n\n1. 正常路径：前置=task3/5 完成 + RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR 指向 temp；输入=运行 DeployRickCustomizations；\n   操作=运行 + `test -f agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` + 解析 agents/ 下 frontmatter 的\n   `name` 字段（等价于 pi 真实发现入口 `{action:\"list\"}` 所列 agent 名）；预期=3 文件存在、\n   `head -5 think.md` 含 `name: think`、发现清单 = {think,research,exporter}，且 frontmatter 含\n   name/description/tools/defaultContext + rick-managed: true 标记、tools 对齐 pi 工具名。\n\n2. 边界（幂等 + 覆盖语义）：前置=已注册一次；输入=再次运行；操作=再次运行 + sha256 对比前后；\n   预期=内容不变（幂等）；另预置无 rick-managed: true 的同名文件 → 运行后不被覆盖（仅覆盖有\n   标记的文件）；反向预置含 rick-managed: true 的陈旧文件 → 运行后被覆盖为最新 wiki 正文。\n\n3. 异常（system prompt 非空）：前置=3 文件已写；输入=无；操作=解析 frontmatter 闭合后的正文，\n   等价 `awk '/^---$/{n++} n>=2 && /[^[:space:]]/{print}'` 统计非空行；预期=每文件 ≥1 且含\n   对应 skill wiki 标记（skill:think / skill:research / skill:exporter）。\n\n脚本只读代码 + 跑 go run 临时程序 + go test ./internal/env/...，产物落临时目录，幂等；\n仅向 stdout 输出一行 JSON。\n\"\"\"\nimport hashlib\nimport json\nimport os\nimport shutil\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\n\n\n# 3 个 agent 的期望规格：key = agent 名（也是文件名 {key}.md）。\nAGENTS = {\n    'think': {\n        'tools': ['read', 'grep', 'find', 'ls'],\n        'skill_marker': 'skill:think',\n    },\n    'research': {\n        'tools': ['read', 'grep', 'find', 'ls', 'bash', 'web_search', 'fetch_content'],\n        'skill_marker': 'skill:research',\n    },\n    'exporter': {\n        'tools': ['read', 'write', 'bash'],\n        'skill_marker': 'skill:exporter',\n    },\n}\n\n\n# 临时 Go 程序：真实调用 env.DeployRickCustomizations()。第一个参数为运行期 cwd\n# （chdir 后 workspace.GetRickDir() 才能定位到仓库的 .rick/skills 源目录，与 init-pi\n# 从仓库根运行一致）。\n_DEPLOY_GO = '''package main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"os\"\n\n\t\"github.com/sunquan/rick/internal/env\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\ttarget := \".\"\n\tif len(os.Args) > 1 {\n\t\ttarget = os.Args[1]\n\t}\n\tif err := os.Chdir(target); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"chdir %s failed: %v\\\\n\", target, err)\n\t\tos.Exit(2)\n\t}\n\tif err := env.DeployRickCustomizations(); err != nil {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintf(os.Stderr, \"deploy failed: %v\\\\n\", err)\n\t\tos.Exit(1)\n\t}\n\tfmt.Println(\"deploy-ok\")\n}\n'''\n\n\ndef find_repo_root(start_file):\n    \"\"\"定位仓库根目录（绝对路径）。\n\n    优先向上查找 .git 标记；若不存在则回退到脚本相对路径：\n    脚本位于 <root>/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task9.py，向上 5 层即仓库根。\n    \"\"\"\n    d = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(start_file))\n    probe = d\n    while True:\n        if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(probe, '.git')):\n            return probe\n        parent = os.path.dirname(probe)\n        if parent == probe:\n            break\n        probe = parent\n    for _ in range(5):\n        d = os.path.dirname(d)\n    return d\n\n\ndef run(cmd, cwd, timeout=300, env=None):\n    \"\"\"运行子进程，返回 (returncode, stdout, stderr)。\"\"\"\n    try:\n        p = subprocess.run(\n            cmd, cwd=cwd, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=timeout, env=env\n        )\n        return p.returncode, p.stdout, p.stderr\n    except FileNotFoundError as e:\n        return 127, '', str(e)\n    except subprocess.TimeoutExpired as e:\n        out = e.stdout or ''\n        err = (e.stderr or '') + '\\n[timeout after %ds]' % timeout\n        return 124, out, err\n\n\ndef tail(text, n=1600):\n    \"\"\"截取文本尾部，用于错误信息（避免刷屏）。\"\"\"\n    if not text:\n        return ''\n    return text[-n:]\n\n\ndef read_text(path):\n    \"\"\"读取文本文件内容，失败返回 None。\"\"\"\n    try:\n        with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            return f.read()\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\n\ndef write_file(path, content):\n    \"\"\"写文件并自动创建父目录。\"\"\"\n    os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n    with open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        f.write(content)\n\n\ndef sha256_file(path):\n    \"\"\"计算文件 sha256（十六进制），失败返回 None。\"\"\"\n    h = hashlib.sha256()\n    try:\n        with open(path, 'rb') as f:\n            for chunk in iter(lambda: f.read(65536), b''):\n                h.update(chunk)\n        return h.hexdigest()\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\n\ndef parse_frontmatter(content):\n    \"\"\"解析 agent 文件，返回 (frontmatter dict, body 字符串, error)。\n\n    frontmatter 由首行 `---` 与随后的第一个 `---` 行闭合；body 为闭合之后全部内容。\n    （skill wiki 正文内部出现的 `---` 水平线属于 body，不影响解析。）\n    \"\"\"\n    if content is None:\n        return None, None, 'file not readable'\n    lines = content.split('\\n')\n    if not lines or lines[0].strip() != '---':\n        return None, None, 'missing opening ---'\n    end = None\n    for i in range(1, len(lines)):\n        if lines[i].strip() == '---':\n            end = i\n            break\n    if end is None:\n        return None, None, 'missing closing ---'\n    fm = {}\n    for ln in lines[1:end]:\n        ln = ln.strip()\n        if not ln or ln.startswith('#'):\n            continue\n        if ':' in ln:\n            k, v = ln.split(':', 1)\n            fm[k.strip()] = v.strip()\n    body = '\\n'.join(lines[end + 1:])\n    return fm, body, None\n\n\ndef count_body_nonblank(body):\n    \"\"\"等价 awk '/^---$/{n++} n>=2 && /[^[:space:]]/{print}' 的非空正文行数。\"\"\"\n    if not body:\n        return 0\n    return sum(1 for ln in body.split('\\n') if ln.strip())\n\n\ndef discover_agent_names(agents_dir):\n    \"\"\"从 agents 目录解析各 .md 的 frontmatter name 字段（等价于 pi {action:\"list\"} 列名）。\"\"\"\n    names = set()\n    if not os.path.isdir(agents_dir):\n        return names\n    for fn in sorted(os.listdir(agents_dir)):\n        if not fn.endswith('.md'):\n            continue\n        content = read_text(os.path.join(agents_dir, fn))\n        fm, _, err = parse_frontmatter(content)\n        if err is None and fm.get('name'):\n            names.add(fm['name'])\n    return names\n\n\ndef write_deploy_program(repo_root):\n    \"\"\"在仓库根下建一个 `.tmp_task9_*` 目录写入临时 Go 程序，返回该目录路径。\n\n    `.` 前缀目录不会被 `go build ./...` / `go test ./...` 拾取；位于模块内方可导入\n    internal 包。运行期 cwd 由程序参数控制（见 _DEPLOY_GO）。\n    \"\"\"\n    tmpdir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='.tmp_task9_deploy_', dir=repo_root)\n    write_file(os.path.join(tmpdir, 'main.go'), _DEPLOY_GO)\n    return tmpdir\n\n\ndef run_deploy(go, prog_dir, target_cwd, agent_dir, home):\n    \"\"\"运行临时 Go 程序调用 DeployRickCustomizations，返回 (rc, out, err)。\"\"\"\n    env = os.environ.copy()\n    env['RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR'] = agent_dir\n    env['HOME'] = home\n    return run([go, 'run', '.', target_cwd], cwd=prog_dir, timeout=240, env=env)\n\n\ndef main():\n    errors = []\n\n    repo_root = find_repo_root(__file__)\n    go = shutil.which('go')\n    if not go:\n        result = {'pass': False, 'errors': ['go toolchain not found in PATH']}\n        print(json.dumps(result))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    prog_dir = write_deploy_program(repo_root)\n\n    # ================= 正常路径 =================\n    agent_dir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_agent_')\n    home = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_home_')\n    rc, out, err = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, agent_dir, home)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (正常路径) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc, tail(err or out)))\n    else:\n        # 3 文件存在 + frontmatter 字段校验。\n        for name in AGENTS:\n            p = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n            if not os.path.isfile(p):\n                errors.append('%s.md 未落盘: %s' % (name, p))\n                continue\n            content = read_text(p)\n            fm, body, ferr = parse_frontmatter(content)\n            if ferr:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 解析失败: %s' % (name, ferr))\n                continue\n            if fm.get('name') != name:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter name=%r, want %r' % (name, fm.get('name'), name))\n            got_tools = sorted(t.strip() for t in fm.get('tools', '').split(',') if t.strip())\n            want_tools = sorted(AGENTS[name]['tools'])\n            if got_tools != want_tools:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter tools=%r, want %r' % (name, got_tools, want_tools))\n            if not fm.get('description'):\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 缺非空 description' % name)\n            if not fm.get('defaultContext'):\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 缺非空 defaultContext' % name)\n            if fm.get('rick-managed') != 'true':\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 缺 rick-managed: true 标记' % name)\n\n        # `head -5 think.md` 含 `name: think`。\n        think_path = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', 'think.md')\n        think_content = read_text(think_path)\n        if think_content is None:\n            errors.append('think.md 无法读取（head -5 检查）')\n        else:\n            head5 = '\\n'.join(think_content.split('\\n')[:5])\n            if 'name: think' not in head5:\n                errors.append('head -5 think.md 不含 `name: think`')\n\n        # 真实发现入口（等价：agents/ 下 frontmatter name 字段集合）。\n        discovered = discover_agent_names(os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents'))\n        if discovered != set(AGENTS.keys()):\n            errors.append('agent 发现清单 = %s, want %s'\n                          % (sorted(discovered), sorted(AGENTS.keys())))\n\n        # ================= 边界：幂等 =================\n        before = {}\n        for name in AGENTS:\n            p = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n            if os.path.isfile(p):\n                before[name] = sha256_file(p)\n        rc2, out2, err2 = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, agent_dir, home)\n        if rc2 != 0:\n            errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (幂等重跑) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc2, tail(err2 or out2)))\n        else:\n            changed = []\n            for name, digest in before.items():\n                p = os.path.join(agent_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n                if not os.path.isfile(p):\n                    changed.append('%s(file missing)' % name)\n                elif sha256_file(p) != digest:\n                    changed.append(name)\n            if changed:\n                errors.append('幂等重跑后文件内容变化（不幂等）: %s' % ', '.join(changed))\n\n    # ================= 边界：覆盖语义（无标记不覆盖） =================\n    ow_dir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_ow_')\n    ow_home = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_owhome_')\n    think_ow = os.path.join(ow_dir, 'agents', 'think.md')\n    user_content = '---\\nname: think\\ndescription: user custom agent\\ntools: read\\n---\\nUSER CUSTOM BODY\\n'\n    write_file(think_ow, user_content)\n    rc, out, err = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, ow_dir, ow_home)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (覆盖语义-无标记) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc, tail(err or out)))\n    else:\n        after_content = read_text(think_ow)\n        if after_content != user_content:\n            errors.append('无 rick-managed: true 标记的 think.md 被覆盖（应跳过不覆盖）')\n        for name in ('research', 'exporter'):\n            p = os.path.join(ow_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n            if not os.path.isfile(p):\n                errors.append('覆盖语义（无标记）场景下 %s.md 未落盘' % name)\n\n    # ================= 边界：覆盖语义（有标记才覆盖） =================\n    mk_dir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_mk_')\n    mk_home = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_mkhome_')\n    research_mk = os.path.join(mk_dir, 'agents', 'research.md')\n    stale = ('---\\nname: research\\ndescription: stale rick agent\\ntools: read\\n'\n             'defaultContext: fresh\\nrick-managed: true\\n---\\nSTALE BODY\\n')\n    write_file(research_mk, stale)\n    rc, out, err = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, mk_dir, mk_home)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (覆盖语义-有标记) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc, tail(err or out)))\n    else:\n        after_content = read_text(research_mk)\n        if after_content == stale:\n            errors.append('含 rick-managed: true 的 research.md 未被覆盖（应覆盖）')\n        elif 'STALE BODY' in (after_content or ''):\n            errors.append('含 rick-managed: true 的 research.md 覆盖后仍含 STALE BODY')\n        elif 'skill:research' not in (after_content or ''):\n            errors.append('覆盖后 research.md 缺 skill:research 正文（覆盖内容不对）')\n\n    # ================= 异常：system prompt 非空 =================\n    ex_dir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_ex_')\n    ex_home = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix='rick_task9_exhome_')\n    rc, out, err = run_deploy(go, prog_dir, repo_root, ex_dir, ex_home)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('DeployRickCustomizations (异常阶段) exit=%d:\\n%s' % (rc, tail(err or out)))\n    else:\n        for name in AGENTS:\n            p = os.path.join(ex_dir, 'agents', name + '.md')\n            if not os.path.isfile(p):\n                errors.append('异常阶段 %s.md 未落盘' % name)\n                continue\n            content = read_text(p)\n            fm, body, ferr = parse_frontmatter(content)\n            if ferr:\n                errors.append('异常阶段 %s.md frontmatter 解析失败: %s' % (name, ferr))\n                continue\n            if count_body_nonblank(body) < 1:\n                errors.append('%s.md frontmatter 闭合后无非空正文（system prompt 为空）' % name)\n            if AGENTS[name]['skill_marker'] not in (body or ''):\n                errors.append('%s.md system prompt 缺 %s（wiki 内容未注入）'\n                              % (name, AGENTS[name]['skill_marker']))\n\n    # ================= 结构/编译：go test ./internal/env/... =================\n    rc, out, err = run([go, 'test', '-timeout', '120s', './internal/env/...'],\n                       cwd=repo_root, timeout=180)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('go test ./internal/env/... failed:\\n' + tail(err or out))\n\n    # 清理临时 Go 程序目录（agent_dir/home 等系统临时目录由 tempfile 管理）。\n    shutil.rmtree(prog_dir, ignore_errors=True)\n\n    result = {\n        'pass': len(errors) == 0,\n        'errors': errors,\n    }\n\n    # CRITICAL: 仅此一行输出到 stdout\n    print(json.dumps(result))\n\n    sys.exit(0 if result['pass'] else 1)\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786916006678},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is very helpful. The task9.py test uses a temporary Go program that calls `env.DeployRickCustomizations()` with `RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR` pointed to a temp dir. This is the pattern for verifying the agent deployment.\n\nFor task12, the O3 check \"3 个 agent 文件\" should follow a similar approach: deploy to a temp dir and verify the 3 agent files + rick-gates extension are deployed.\n\nBut wait — task12 is an end-to-end acceptance. The test method says \"前置条件 = task8~11 完成 + `rick tools init-pi` 已成功\". So the agents should already be deployed via init-pi. But since init-pi hasn't been re-run after task9, the default `~/.rick/pi/agent/agents/` doesn't exist.\n\nHmm. Let me think about the most appropriate test design for task12.\n\nGiven the task12 test method's O3: \"workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py\", and KR1's detail \"显式 export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>（或改用 ~/.rick/pi/agent 默认路径）后，$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md 3 文件存在 + $RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/ 已部署\".\n\nThe cleanest, most robust, and self-contained approach (matching task9.py's proven pattern) is:\n1. Set RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR to a temp dir\n2. Run `env.DeployRickCustomizations()` (via a temp Go program, like task9 did)\n3. Verify `agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 files exist\n4. Verify `extensions/rick-gates/` deployed (helper.py exists there)\n\nThis is the \"真实落盘\" (real deployment) check, not just checking the source files.\n\nBut also, KR1 has a simpler O3 check: \"test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py\" — this checks the SOURCE helper.py exists. This is separate from the deployed extension.\n\nActually, let me re-read KR1 O3 in full:\n\n```\nO3：`grep -rc workflowScript internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l` ≥1；显式 `export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>`（或改用 `~/.rick/pi/agent` 默认路径）后，`$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/agents/{think,research,exporter}.md` 3 文件存在 + `$RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR/extensions/rick-gates/` 已部署；`test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py`；自然语言触发词计数下降（正则口径与 RFC §2.1 基线一致：含 bare `subagent`/`Sub Agent`/`SPAWN`/`子 Agent`，迁移前后用同一正则对比，迁移后 < 迁移前基线）\n```\n\nSo O3 has 4 assertions:\n1. workflowScript count ≥1 (in templates)\n2. 3 agent files + rick-gates extension deployed (after export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR)\n3. `test -f .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py` (source)\n4. natural language trigger count decreased\n\nFor assertion #2, the key is \"显式 export RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR=<temp>... 后，...文件存在...已部署\". This means: after exporting RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR to a temp dir, run the deploy, and check the files exist.\n\nSo I should follow task9.py's approach: use a temp Go program to call `env.DeployRickCustomizations()` with RICK_PI_AGENT_DIR pointing to a temp dir, then verify the 3 agent files + extensions/rick-gates/helper.py.\n\nThis is the right approach because:\n1. It's self-contained and doesn't pollute the real `~/.rick/pi/agent`\n2. It verifies the ACTUAL deployment behavior (not mock)\n3. It matches the proven task9.py pattern\n4. It doesn't require `rick tools init-pi` to have actually been run (which may be expensive/side-effectful)\n\nNow for the trigger count baseline. task11.py dumped baseline=109 using its regex. But task12 KR1 says \"正则口径与 RFC §2.1 基线一致：含 bare `subagent`/`Sub Agent`/`SPAWN`/`子 Agent`\".\n\nHmm, there's a discrepancy. task11.py's regex is more specific:\n```\n派发\\s*subagent|SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent|SPAWN\\s+Step|子\\s*Agent|父\\s*Agent|Main\\s+Agent|Sub\\s+Agent|每个\\s+subagent\\s+独立启动\n```\n\ntask12 KR1 says: 含 bare `subagent`/`Sub Agent`/`SPAWN`/`子 Agent`.\n\nBut the baseline file (trigger-baseline.txt = 109) was dumped by task11.py's regex. So to compare \"迁移后 < 迁移前基线\" with the SAME regex, I should use task11.py's regex.\n\nActually, wait. Let me re-read the task12 KR1 note: \"自然语言触发词计数下降（正则口径与 RFC §2.1 基线一致：含 bare `subagent`/`Sub Agent`/`SPAWN`/`子 Agent`，迁移前后用同一正则对比，迁移后 < 迁移前基线）\".\n\nThe key point is \"迁移前后用同一正则对比\" — use the same regex before and after. The baseline was dumped with task11.py's regex (109). So I should use task11.py's regex to compute the current count and compare.\n\nCurrent count with task11.py's regex = 0. Baseline = 109. 0 < 109. ✓ Passes.\n\nActually, let me also check: what's the count with a \"bare subagent/Sub Agent/SPAWN/子 Agent\" regex? The baseline file says 109 (from task11's regex). But actually, wait — was the baseline really 109 with task11's regex? Let me check git history of the baseline file.\n\nActually, the trigger-baseline.txt contains \"109\". This was written by task11.py --dump-baseline using its regex. So the baseline is 109 for task11's regex.\n\nFor consistency, I'll use task11.py's exact regex (which is the one that produced the baseline) to compute the current count and assert current < baseline.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task12 KR1 says the regex scope is \"含 bare `subagent`/`Sub Agent`/`SPAWN`/`子 Agent`\". This is DIFFERENT from task11's regex. But the baseline (109) was dumped with task11's regex.\n\nHmm, this is getting complicated. Let me check the RFC §2.1 to understand the exact regex scope. Actually, let me just check what makes sense:\n\nThe task12 test should verify \"自然语言触发词下降\" (natural language trigger words decreased). The most robust approach:\n1. Read the baseline from trigger-baseline.txt (109)\n2. Compute current count using the SAME regex that produced the baseline (task11's regex)\n3. Assert current < baseline\n\nThis is consistent with \"迁移前后用同一正则对比\". I'll reuse task11.py's regex exactly.\n\nActually, let me also verify: does the trigger-baseline.txt format just contain \"109\\n\"? Yes, from task11.py --dump-baseline it writes `str(count) + '\\n'`.\n\nNow let me also understand the O1 check more precisely.\n\nO1 KR1:\n```\nO1：`test -f .rick/domain/spec.md && test -f .rick/domain/rick-spec.md`；`for w in 模块边界 职责 接口契约 验收标准; do grep -q \"$w\" .rick/domain/rick-spec.md || exit 1; done`；`grep -q '功能等价' .rick/domain/rick-spec.md`；`grep -qE 'dry-run|go test|集成测试' .rick/domain/spec.md`（可操作判据被枚举）\n```\n\nSo O1 has 4 assertions:\n1. Both spec.md and rick-spec.md exist\n2. rick-spec.md contains all four keywords: 模块边界, 职责, 接口契约, 验收标准\n3. rick-spec.md contains '功能等价'\n4. spec.md contains 'dry-run' or 'go test' or '集成测试' (operational criteria enumerated)\n\nThe 测试方法 says \"O1 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\". So:\n- Two spec files exist\n- Four element keywords (模块边界/职责/接口契约/验收标准) — in BOTH files? Or just rick-spec.md?\n\nKR1 says the four-element keyword loop checks rick-spec.md specifically. But the 测试方法 says \"两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价\" which is more general.\n\nActually, let me look at the O1 task description again: \"O1（spec 信息内核）：`.rick/domain/spec.md` + `.rick/domain/rick-spec.md` 存在且含四要素 + 验收标准\".\n\nSo both files must contain the four elements + acceptance criteria. Both spec.md and rick-spec.md should contain 四要素 (模块边界/职责/接口契约/验收标准).\n\nActually, spec.md is the meta-spec (定义四要素模板), so it contains the four element definitions. rick-spec.md is the instance (填写了四要素). Both should contain the four keywords.\n\nFrom my earlier grep:\n- spec.md: 模块边界=3, 职责=10, 接口契约=4, 验收标准=10 ✓ all present\n- rick-spec.md: 模块边界=2, 职责=14, 接口契约=2, 验收标准=3 ✓ all present\n\nSo both contain all four keywords.\n\nFor robustness, I'll check that BOTH files contain all four keywords. Plus:\n- rick-spec.md contains '功能等价'\n- spec.md contains operational criteria (dry-run / go test / 集成测试)\n\nLet me verify spec.md contains these operational keywords.\n\nFrom the spec.md read earlier, it contains \"dry-run\" (in the 判据 table), \"go test\" (unit test command), \"集成测试\" (integration test). ✓\n\nAnd rick-spec.md contains '功能等价' (multiple times). ✓\n\nNow O2:\n```\nO2：`ls internal/cmd internal/handler internal/env internal/builder internal/runtime` 均存在；`for d in executor parser actpath logging git agent; do test ! -d internal/$d || exit 1; done`（6 冗余包全删）\n```\n- 5 directories exist: cmd, handler, env, builder, runtime\n- 6 redundant packages deleted: executor, parser, actpath, logging, git, agent\n\nThe 测试方法 says \"O2 5 目录存在 + 6 冗余包 `test ! -d`\".\n\nAlso the O2 description mentions \"职责与 spec 对应\" (responsibilities match spec) and \"rick 全命令可用\" (all commands available). The 全命令可用 is covered by the 边界 test (Test 2). The \"职责与 spec 对应\" is hard to test precisely; KR1 focuses on directory existence + redundant package deletion.\n\nActually, let me also check KR5 (扩展点验收) which is mentioned in the plan but NOT in the 测试方法. The 测试方法 only lists 3 paths (正常路径/边界/异常). So I'll focus on those 3.\n\nBut wait, the plan's 测试方法 section is what the test prompt's \"测试方法\" section copied. Let me re-read the test prompt's 测试方法:\n\n```\n正常路径（三 O 验收）：前置条件 = task8~11 完成 + `rick tools init-pi` 已成功；输入 = 无；操作 = 依次执行 KR1 的三组断言（O1 两个 spec 文件 + 四要素关键词 + 功能等价；O2 5 目录存在 + 6 冗余包 `test ! -d`；O3 workflowScript 计数 ≥1 + 3 个 agent 文件 + rick-gates helper.py）；预期 = 全部通过。\n边界（命令全可用）：前置条件 = build 成功；输入 = 各子命令 `--help`；操作 = `./bin/rick --help` + 8 个子命令 `--help`；预期 = 均 exit 0、无 panic、含 plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl。\n异常（回滚兜底）：前置条件 = 某命令行为异常；输入 = 无；操作 = 记录当前 release commit（`git log --oneline -1`）后，在**副本 worktree** 验证回滚：`git worktree add /tmp/rick-rollback <release-commit>` + `cd /tmp/rick-rollback && ./scripts/build.sh && ./bin/rick --help`（exit 0）；预期 = 可回滚且 rick 仍可编译运行（不污染主工作区；`.rick/domain/` 无本 task 变更）。注意 task8 已删 `plan_check`/`doing_check` 命令，回滚验证改用 `./bin/rick --help`。\n```\n\nSo the three test paths:\n1. 正常路径: O1 + O2 + O3 assertions\n2. 边界: all commands --help\n3. 异常: rollback verification\n\nFor O3's \"3 个 agent 文件\", I'll use the temp-dir deploy approach (like task9.py), verifying:\n- 3 agent files exist after deploy\n- rick-gates extension deployed\n- .rick/skills/rick-gates/helper.py source exists\n\nFor O3's \"workflowScript 计数 ≥1\": count files in templates containing workflowScript (or runs.run), assert ≥1.\n\nFor O3's \"自然语言触发词下降\": current < baseline (using task11's regex).\n\nNow let me also think about the boundary test (command --help). The 8 subcommands are: plan, doing, easy, learning, dream, tools, human-loop, ctrl.\n\nWait, let me verify the exact subcommands. From `./bin/rick --help`:\n```\nAvailable Commands:\n  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\n  ctrl        Monitor and intervene in a background doing session\n  doing       Execute tasks in a job\n  dream       Cross-job global reflection and skill evolution\n  easy        Start an interactive easy AI coding session\n  help        Help about any command\n  human-loop  Start a human-loop thinking session with AI assistance\n  learning    Analyze and document learnings from job execution\n  plan        Plan a new job with AI assistance\n  tools       Meta-skill tools for validating and managing Rick workflows\n```\n\nThe 8 subcommands to test: plan, doing, easy, learning, dream, tools, human-loop, ctrl. (completion and help are excluded — they're auto-generated by cobra).\n\nSo I'll test: `./bin/rick <cmd> --help` for each of the 8, plus `./bin/rick --help`.\n\nFor \"无 panic\", I check exit code 0 and that stderr/stdout doesn't contain \"panic\".\n\nFor \"含 plan/doing/easy/learning/dream/tools/human-loop/ctrl\", I check the root --help output contains these command names.\n\nNow the rollback test (异常/回滚兜底):\n```\ngit log --oneline -1  → record current release commit\ngit worktree add /tmp/rick-rollback <release-commit>\ncd /tmp/rick-rollback && ./scripts/build.sh && ./bin/rick --help (exit 0)\n```\n\nThis is a potentially expensive test (build.sh compiles the Go project). But it's required by the test method.\n\nAlso: \"不污染主工作区；`.rick/domain/` 无本 task 变更\" — check `git status .rick/domain/` has no changes.\n\nLet me check the scripts/build.sh to understand what it does.\n\nActually, let me check build.sh and verify the rollback test works.\n\nLet me also think about whether the rollback test is appropriate to include. The test method explicitly lists it as 异常 path. It's a bit heavy (git worktree add + build). But it's part of the acceptance. I should include it but make it robust:\n- Use a unique temp dir for the worktree\n- Clean up the worktree after (git worktree remove)\n- If git worktree add fails (e.g., already exists), handle gracefully\n\nActually, wait. Let me reconsider. The rollback test adds a worktree of the current commit, builds, and runs --help. This verifies the current commit is buildable/runnable (rollback safety). But it's a bit odd to do in a test. However, it IS in the 测试方法, so I must implement it.\n\nLet me check the build.sh script first.\n\nActually, let me also check the release commit. The task says \"记录当前 release commit\". The current HEAD is be847c7 (task11 success). But is there a \"release commit\"? Let me check git tags or a release.\n\nActually, the test method says \"记录当前 release commit（`git log --oneline -1`）\". So just use HEAD. Then add a worktree at HEAD, build, run --help.\n\nHmm, but actually \"回滚\" (rollback) implies rolling back to a PREVIOUS release. Let me re-read:\n\n\"异常（回滚兜底）：前置条件 = 某命令行为异常；输入 = 无；操作 = 记录当前 release commit（`git log --oneline -1`）后，在**副本 worktree** 验证回滚：`git worktree add /tmp/rick-rollback <release-commit>` + `cd /tmp/rick-rollback && ./scripts/build.sh && ./bin/rick --help`（exit 0）\"\n\nSo: record the current release commit (HEAD), then add a worktree at that commit, build, run --help. The point is to verify that the current state (which should be a good release state) is buildable and runnable — i.e., if something goes wrong, we can roll back to this commit.\n\nActually, \"回滚\" here is about verifying the CURRENT commit can serve as a rollback point — i.e., the repo at HEAD builds and runs. This is a smoke test of the release commit.\n\nI'll implement it as:\n1. Get current commit: `git rev-parse HEAD`\n2. `git worktree add <temp>/rick-rollback <commit>` (or HEAD)\n3. `cd <temp>/rick-rollback && ./scripts/build.sh`\n4. `./bin/rick --help` (exit 0)\n5. Clean up: `git worktree remove <temp>/rick-rollback`\n\nLet me check build.sh.\n\nActually, let me be careful about time. build.sh might take a while (Go build). Let me check.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_RRexqXK1nERqfs4tBjsN3307","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===build.sh===\" && cat scripts/build.sh && echo \"===scripts dir===\" && ls -la scripts/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_01_uuwdtmlwSFTIoUTtWXQ02397","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"===spec.md operational keywords===\" && grep -nE 'dry-run|go test|集成测试' .rick/domain/spec.md | head && echo \"===rick-spec.md 功能等价===\" && grep -c '功能等价' .rick/domain/rick-spec.md && echo \"===git status .rick/domain===\" && git status --porcelain .rick/domain/ && echo \"(empty = clean)\" && echo \"===git tags===\" && git tag | head && echo \"===HEAD===\" && git rev-parse HEAD"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":4377,"output":4490,"cacheRead":57984,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":4241,"totalTokens":66851,"cost":{"input":0.0019039950000000001,"output":0.003906300000000001,"cacheRead":0.00021019200000000002,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006020487000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786916006680,"responseId":"2dfb001a-5db9-489a-b826-f1f8d120a615","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_RRexqXK1nERqfs4tBjsN3307","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"===build.sh===\n#!/bin/bash\n#\n# build.sh - Build script for Rick CLI\n#\n# Usage:\n#   ./scripts/build.sh [--output OUTPUT_PATH]\n#\n# Options:\n#   --output OUTPUT_PATH    Specify output binary path (default: ./bin/rick)\n#   -h, --help              Show this help message\n#\n\nset -e\n\n# Script directory\nSCRIPT_DIR=\"$(cd \"$(dirname \"${BASH_SOURCE[0]}\")\" && pwd)\"\nPROJECT_DIR=\"$(dirname \"$SCRIPT_DIR\")\"\n\n# Default output path\nOUTPUT_PATH=\"${PROJECT_DIR}/bin/rick\"\n\n# Colors for output\nRED='\\033[0;31m'\nGREEN='\\033[0;32m'\nYELLOW='\\033[1;33m'\nNC='\\033[0m' # No Color\n\n# Functions\nprint_error() {\n    echo -e \"${RED}[ERROR]${NC} $1\" >&2\n}\n\nprint_success() {\n    echo -e \"${GREEN}[SUCCESS]${NC} $1\"\n}\n\nprint_info() {\n    echo -e \"${YELLOW}[INFO]${NC} $1\"\n}\n\nshow_help() {\n    sed -n '2,/^$/p' \"$0\" | sed 's/^# //' | sed 's/^#//'\n}\n\ncheck_go_version() {\n    if ! command -v go &> /dev/null; then\n        print_error \"Go is not installed. Please install Go 1.21 or later.\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    local go_version=$(go version | awk '{print $3}' | sed 's/go//')\n    local required_version=\"1.21\"\n\n    # Compare versions\n    if ! printf '%s\\n' \"$required_version\" \"$go_version\" | sort -V -C; then\n        print_error \"Go version $go_version is not supported. Please use Go $required_version or later.\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    print_info \"Go version $go_version is compatible.\"\n    return 0\n}\n\nparse_args() {\n    while [[ $# -gt 0 ]]; do\n        case $1 in\n            --output)\n                OUTPUT_PATH=\"$2\"\n                shift 2\n                ;;\n            -h|--help)\n                show_help\n                exit 0\n                ;;\n            *)\n                print_error \"Unknown option: $1\"\n                show_help\n                exit 1\n                ;;\n        esac\n    done\n}\n\nbuild_binary() {\n    # Ensure output directory exists\n    local output_dir=$(dirname \"$OUTPUT_PATH\")\n    if ! mkdir -p \"$output_dir\"; then\n        print_error \"Failed to create output directory: $output_dir\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    print_info \"Building Rick CLI...\"\n    print_info \"Output path: $OUTPUT_PATH\"\n\n    # Build the binary\n    if ! go build -o \"$OUTPUT_PATH\" \"$PROJECT_DIR/cmd/rick\"; then\n        print_error \"Build failed. Please check the error messages above.\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    print_success \"Build completed successfully.\"\n    return 0\n}\n\nverify_binary() {\n    if [[ ! -f \"$OUTPUT_PATH\" ]]; then\n        print_error \"Binary file not found: $OUTPUT_PATH\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    if [[ ! -x \"$OUTPUT_PATH\" ]]; then\n        print_error \"Binary is not executable: $OUTPUT_PATH\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    # Try to run the binary with --version or --help\n    if ! \"$OUTPUT_PATH\" --help &> /dev/null; then\n        print_error \"Binary verification failed. The binary may be corrupted.\"\n        return 1\n    fi\n\n    print_info \"Binary verification passed.\"\n    return 0\n}\n\n# Main execution\nmain() {\n    parse_args \"$@\"\n\n    print_info \"Starting build process...\"\n\n    if ! check_go_version; then\n        exit 1\n    fi\n\n    if ! build_binary; then\n        exit 1\n    fi\n\n    if ! verify_binary; then\n        exit 1\n    fi\n\n    print_success \"Rick CLI build completed successfully!\"\n    echo \"\"\n    echo \"Binary location: $OUTPUT_PATH\"\n}\n\n# Run main function\nmain \"$@\"\n===scripts dir===\ntotal 100\ndrwxr-xr-x  2 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 12 18:32 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 13 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  4096 Aug 17 05:07 ..\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  3278 Aug  7 19:53 build.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x  1 hadoop-recsys hadoop-recsys  7342 Aug  7 19:53 ch